msgid "tankman/lore/Lumberjack"
msgstr ""
"Commander Jack \"Lumberjack\" Thompson, a rugged lumberman from the American"
" Pacific Northwest, is known for his sharp ax. He transitioned from felling "
"trees to commanding tanks, applying his strategic thinking on how to knock "
"things down to the battlefield. His strength and understanding of terrain "
"and machinery make him a formidable opponent in World of Tanks."

msgid "tankman/lore/Marty_Vole"
msgstr ""
"A well-known Czech content creator and frequent tournament caster, "
"Marty_Vole is now ready to conquer the battlefield as a Commander. Whether "
"you're a fan of his streams or just need a Commander who'll provide some "
"extra flair in battle, one thing is for sure: with his trademark insight, "
"analysis, and in-depth knowledge of all things WoT, you won't regret putting"
" Marty_Vole in charge of your vehicle's crew!"

msgid "tankman/lore/birthday14_cat"
msgstr ""
"Sure, Claudia may occasionally sleep a little before an important battle, "
"but one thing's for sure—on the battlefield, you won't catch her napping. "
"Cunning and crafty by nature, she's a master of strategy, happy to play the "
"waiting game before striking from cover at just the right moment. No matter "
"how heated things get in battle, Claudia's natural grace and composure mean "
"she always manages to land on her feet."

msgid "tankman/lore/birthday14_deer"
msgstr ""
"Donny is daring, determined, and likes to dive into the heat of battle head "
"first. After all, why waste time sitting around when there's fun to be had? "
"While his dynamism and eagerness to impress may not always bring the desired"
" results, Donny's bold battle style means he fears no enemy—not even in the "
"most intense of situations. Even when it can feel like all is lost, Donny "
"might just come in clutch."

msgid "tankman/lore/birthday14_mouse"
msgstr ""
"What's the matter? Never seen a shredded mouse before? Despite boasting "
"impressive guns, Markus prefers to try and find a diplomatic solution where "
"possible. He's not a fan of brute force, but if push comes to shove—say, he "
"needs to use his considerable size to protect an ally—then he's ready to do "
"what it takes. And if there's cheese at stake, then this mouse isn't going "
"to go quietly."

msgid "tankman/lore/birthday16_crew_1"
msgstr ""
"Give a tanker a hot dog, and he'll eat for a day. Give Todd Jefferson a "
"grill, and he'll make enough hot dogs to feed a whole unit for a month. The "
"garage's most senior engineer, Todd felt a sense of paternal duty toward its"
" younger recruits, and took it upon himself to make sure they felt at home "
"from day one. Typically, that involved plying them with grilled meat at "
"impromptu welcome barbecues. An anniversary road trip, therefore, presented "
"the perfect opportunity to indulge in the two things that brought him the "
"most joy: firing up engines by day, then firing up his portable grill by "
"night."

msgid "tankman/lore/birthday16_crew_2"
msgstr ""
"When the garage whistle blew and the mechanics traipsed homeward after a "
"long shift, Bobby Ray always had other plans. The din of heavy machinery "
"still ringing in his ears and a roguish smile on his face, he would bolt "
"from the factory floor, grab his guitar from his locker, and make a beeline "
"for the all-night rock 'n' roll club. So when his colleagues proposed a road"
" trip to celebrate 16 years of tanking, there was no way Bobby wouldn't be "
"providing the soundtrack; he'd tested countless weapons in his time, but "
"he'd never found one as deadly as his trusty archtop semi-acoustic."

msgid "tankman/lore/birthday16_crew_3"
msgstr ""
"Rosie Burns's garage colleagues swore by two credos: if it ain't broke, "
"don't fix it; and if it is broke, then call Rosie. A high school baseball "
"star turned tank mechanic extraordinaire, she enjoyed nothing more than "
"rolling her sleeves up and solving the problems that had everyone else "
"stumped. That knack for fixing the unfixable made her the perfect companion "
"for an anniversary tanking trip: this was a woman who knew how to keep "
"engines running, tracks rolling, and spirits high. No matter what curveballs"
" the journey might throw, you could rely on Rosie to have all bases covered."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander1_asia"
msgstr ""
"A former commander of the "
"Tigers&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;natural&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;born predators that rely on "
"surprise attacks. A great team player."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander1_eu"
msgstr ""
"German efficiency at its finest. Mailand knows the game by heart, and he's "
"all heart. You better not stand in his way."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander1_na"
msgstr ""
"A former commander of the "
"Tigers&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;natural&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;born predators that rely on "
"surprise attacks. A great team player."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander1_ru"
msgstr ""
"One of the eSport elements in the periodic table of content creators, the "
"Steelest Hunter of 2019, a regular organizer of large unofficial "
"World&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tanks tournaments, and the Battle&nbsp;of&nbsp;Bloggers "
"2018 champion. He formed the KOPM and KOPM2 clans and now motivates players "
"to create Strongholds."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander2_asia"
msgstr ""
"A former commander of the "
"Dragons&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;high&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;and&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;mighty "
"warriors who favor devastating head-on assaults but can also prove their "
"worth as individuals."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander2_eu"
msgstr ""
"Join the Baboon Empire and rule over the World&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tanks galaxy. "
"Just prepare your best Russian accent and you'll be all set to support "
"Skill4ltu!"

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander2_na"
msgstr ""
"A former commander of the "
"Dragons&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;high&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;and&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;mighty "
"warriors who favor devastating head-on assaults but can also prove their "
"worth as individuals."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander2_ru"
msgstr ""
"The people's creator and author of the popular PROTanki mod pack. He is "
"always one of the first to share World&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tanks news and to create"
" entertaining tutorials and video guides on how to use the vehicles in the "
"game."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander3_eu"
msgstr ""
"Who doesn't enjoy a good mystery? DezGamez remains anonymous. We may have "
"never seen his face, but we all fear his skills. Follow him into battle once"
" again."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander3_ru"
msgstr ""
"The warm-hearted host of cozy evening streams. One of the first "
"World&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tanks content creators with a large friendly audience of "
"more than 2 million people and at least one rabbit."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander4_eu"
msgstr ""
"The dynamic duo is back! Straight outta Sweden, the AwesomeEpicGuys have "
"sworn to share the crown between them and their famous pickle!"

msgid "tankman/lore/bob20_commander4_ru"
msgstr ""
"A promising young content creator and top shooter. He is known for his hot "
"temper, as well as his unconventional thinking and approach to the game. Has"
" lots of very active, loyal viewers that helped him get here."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_asia1_Mastertortoise"
msgstr ""
"Tired of your shots missing, bouncing, or not penetrating? Join the mighty "
"Master Tortoise, and feel the power of the red shell. The red shell of "
"Master Tortoise never misses..."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_asia2_Summertiger"
msgstr ""
"Join the K-Tank Empire and conquer World&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tanks APAC with Summer"
" Tiger! Summer Tiger: F7, F7. Follow Summer Tiger and victory will be ours!"

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_asia3_Maharlika"
msgstr ""
"Team Maharlika: strong, noble, and not afraid to press 2. Join Conan in the "
"quest for victory, great justice, and food. He likes food."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_eu1_Circon"
msgstr ""
"All he needs is a pixel and a dream. Always assessing the situation and "
"looking five steps ahead, his actions are precise and the consequences "
"inevitable. Each action is carefully calculated."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_eu2_Dakillzor"
msgstr ""
"Competitive to the bone! Ready to win at any cost, he shows no mercy to his "
"opponents. His famous pink hat will boost your confidence while protecting "
"your eyes from the burning El Halluf sun."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_eu3_Newmulti2k"
msgstr ""
"Polska siła in action! He's at home on the battlefield. This commander not "
"only knows the Studzianki soundtrack by heart, but also how to make you "
"regret not learning Polish as your second language."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_eu4_Orzanel"
msgstr ""
"He's the second most known persona in Romania. Orzanel's presence on the "
"battlefield strikes fear in his opponents. With his impressive physique and "
"singing skills, he'll either make them cower in terror or randomly start "
"dancing!"

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_na1_Cabbagemechanic"
msgstr ""
"Tinkerers and Planters unite! Calling all tankers who aren't afraid of "
"getting their hands dirty in the garage or the garden! Join CabMech and "
"defend your homestead from the dinosaur and city slicker menace."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_na2_Tragicloss"
msgstr ""
"We're not sure how they got here, but dinosaurs have arrived in World of "
"Tanks. Follow TragicVeLOSSiraptor into battle by joining the dinosaur pack "
"and getting ready to shred the opposition with sheer reptilian power."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_na3_Cmdraf"
msgstr ""
"Lights, camera, explosion! With a clear lens and perfect focus, join Cmdr_AF"
" in battle to snap the perfect shot and jump cut to victory. Together we can"
" fix ‘em in post!"

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru1_Vspishka"
msgstr ""
"Shrewd and level-headed, he expertly analyzes both the current situation and"
" upcoming new features, and loves classic light tanks. Actively engages with"
" his audience and always gives good gaming advice."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru1_Yusha"
msgstr ""
"A real expert in the client side of the game, he can unpack any data from "
"upcoming updates and makes sure to share it with his subscribers. He is "
"always one of the first to create unique review videos and interesting "
"modifications."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru2_Amway921"
msgstr ""
"The physical embodiment of the word \"cozy\". Reviews, engaging live "
"streams, and friendly conversations with the audience: this is what this "
"creator's channel is all about. He also has a fluffy companion who ties all "
"his streams together."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru2_Korbendailas"
msgstr ""
"The author of many reviews and tutorials with information on all vehicles at"
" Tier VIII and higher. Well, almost all of them. He created and promoted the"
" airtight philosophy of \"&zwnbsp;drive at the lower plate, shoot the cap "
"circle&zwnbsp;\"."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru3_Inspirer"
msgstr ""
"A calm, focused content creator who can turn any battle into a victory, even"
" if it looks completely hopeless. If you want to see what nerves of steel "
"look like, you've come to the right place."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru3_Lebwa"
msgstr ""
"Do you miss tournaments? Then LeBwa is your guy! A talented organizer who "
"can manage any in-game event. If someone like him had existed in ancient "
"Rome, we would still be watching battles in the Colosseum."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru4_Evilgranny"
msgstr ""
"A master of bold experiments who is capable of great things in any vehicle, "
"with any equipment, in any conditions. He is always ready to create new "
"content that will always remain relevant."

msgid "tankman/lore/bob21_commander_ru4_Nearyou"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to hear an expert opinion about a map? Or a piece of equipment? "
"Or the features of a certain vehicle? Maybe you just want to get an answer "
"to the question \"&zwnbsp;How to play World of Tanks?&zwnbsp;\" Check out "
"this creator and enjoy impeccable gameplay."

msgid "tankman/lore/boosteroid_extraordinaire"
msgstr ""
"As a boy, Emrah was fascinated by the connections between shadows and the world around him. Driven by his thirst for knowledge and a budding talent for alchemy, he left his family in Turkey to explore the unknown. Along the way, he joined a group of nomadic magicians and sorcerers—and witnessed dark, otherworldly threats.\n"
"Through rigorous training and experimentation, he mastered the art of combining alchemy with the power of metals, before joining a specialized army to fight enemies from other worlds. Now, as a commander, he protects his world from the encroaching darkness."

msgid "tankman/lore/boosteroid_fencer"
msgstr ""
"Don't let her poise and elegance fool you: Adelais is a battle-hardened "
"fencing champion with thousands of duels to her name. Confident, focused, "
"and graceful on the piste, she's armed with lightning-fast reflexes and a "
"riposte for any situation. Yet when she's not putting opponents to the "
"sword, she can be found commanding the battlefield—where she brings the same"
" deadly precision. You might think you're quick, but Adelais is quicker. "
"Now...en garde!"

msgid "tankman/lore/boosteroid_foxwood"
msgstr ""
"Never seen without his trusty hound Winston by his side, William has "
"dedicated his life to the art of hunting. Captivated by the wonders of the "
"forest during childhood outings with his father, he has donned his tweed cap"
" and shooting jacket without fail every day since—come rain or shine. "
"Affable and avuncular when he's not tracking his prey, William is a seasoned"
" marksman with an unerring shot. His hunter's instinct translates seamlessly"
" to tank battles—and once he has a target in his sights, his eagle-eyed "
"focus ensures he never misses the mark."

msgid "tankman/lore/bp-commander-1_1"
msgstr ""
"She's a determined and headstrong lady. In her childhood, she learned the "
"specifics of tank combat from her father. However, later on, she followed in"
" her mother's footsteps and studied medicine. After graduating from the "
"Academy, she had a good track record in field hospitals but insisted on "
"transferring to a tank unit where she hopes to realize her full potential as"
" a tank commander."

msgid "tankman/lore/bp-commander-1_2"
msgstr ""
"An experienced commander who's always cool and calculating. During his 20 "
"years of service, he's braved many challenges, earning his own command while"
" receiving the respect of his comrades-in-arms. He likes to win with honor, "
"keep strict discipline, and comply with the rules of engagement. Due to its "
"outstanding performance, Kilmore's platoon is something of a legend. As an "
"avid surfer, he keeps his surfboard nearby as a good luck charm."

msgid "tankman/lore/chef_damien"
msgstr ""
"Wherever he finds himself, Damien Touttée is always ready to cook up a "
"storm. For this culinary daredevil and tanking virtuoso, the battlefield, "
"like the kitchen, is about expression. A dash of salt here, the blast of an "
"HE shell there; these are the touches—sometimes subtle, sometimes less "
"so—that make up his chefs-d'œuvre. Even when the ingredients are limited, "
"the possibilities are endless for those bold enough to experiment. Give "
"Damien a camp stove, and he'll make a feast. Give him an enemy tank, and "
"he'll make a heap of scrap metal. Just let him cook."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_baroness"
msgstr ""
"The spoiled offspring of European aristocrats, the&nbsp;Baroness graduated "
"from student radicalism and eventually joined the ranks of COBRA. Her chief "
"strength in navigating the organization's power structure is in playing "
"high-ranking members against each other. Rumor has it she is also the only "
"person who knows Destro's true identity."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_bingo"
msgstr ""
"Ah, here we go again. Another day, another poor soul, another few coins in "
"my pocket. Everyone wants to challenge the Gunslinger. Everyone wants to be "
"king of the hill. Just look me in the eye—you're doomed, boy. Turn around, "
"and walk on home while you still can. Hm, thought so. Your call. One step, "
"two steps, three steps... Draw!"

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_bjornson"
msgstr ""
"Like in the old sagas, this warrior has gone viking, but now he rides a "
"drakkar of steel, wielding a gun instead of an axe."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_bp1"
msgstr ""
"A tanker who fights on impulse more than not, and has been with the tank "
"unit since he was a young boy. However, average theory knowledge does not "
"prevent him from defeating enemies in any combat situation. Disposition: "
"difficult, impulsive. Known for his unconventional tactical thinking, which "
"gives him an advantage on the battlefield."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_bp2"
msgstr ""
"Graduated from the Royal Armored Academy with honors, the best cadet in his "
"class. He was an excellent shooter and set the school record for destroying "
"moving targets from a long distance. He has vast knowledge of the "
"specifications of most modern vehicles and takes advantage of them in "
"battles. Disposition: calm, balanced. No disciplinary punishments."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_cesare"
msgstr ""
"A talented female commander who lives up to her name with her passion and "
"joy of battle. Getting her way at all costs, commanding people, and always "
"leading the charge are the three pillars that determine her battle tactics."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_cobra"
msgstr ""
"Cobra Commander is the leader of Cobra, an evil organization determined to "
"rule the world. Cobra's goal is to defeat "
"G&zwnbsp;.&zwnbsp;I&zwnbsp;.&nbsp;Joe and destroy some enemy tanks along the"
" way."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_cover_girl"
msgstr ""
"Cover Girl was initially a high fashion model in New&nbsp;York and Chicago "
"who enlisted in the service, attended Armor&nbsp;School at Fort&nbsp;Knox "
"and related technology schools, and is an expert at diesel mechanics and gas"
" turbine technology."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_duke"
msgstr ""
"A real hero, Duke is the leader of the G&zwnbsp;.&zwnbsp;I&zwnbsp;.&nbsp;Joe"
" team and he's ready to take on his enemies in the name of peace and "
"freedom."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_ferenc"
msgstr ""
"A tank battle is a lot like a football match. You start out neat and "
"cautious, studying your opponents. You take the position that suits your "
"role. You fall back if your teammates need your help. But most importantly, "
"you're always alert, waiting for a chance to strike… And when it's there, "
"all you need is a good shot."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_gagarin21"
msgstr ""
"\"&zwnbsp;Orbiting Earth in the spaceship, I saw how beautiful our planet "
"is. People, let us preserve and increase this beauty, not destroy "
"it!&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_henri"
msgstr ""
"Henri's tactical beard has been groomed to increase his crew's bravery and "
"bring victory, which it does on a regular basis—around 5 times out of 10."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_hillen"
msgstr ""
"I'm a big rugby fan, you know. And the minute they brought me here I "
"immediately felt in my element. I mean, think about it. "
"15&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;on&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;15&nbsp;scrums?&nbsp;Check. Different "
"roles on the battlefield? Check. Tactical variety? Check. Power plays? Loads"
" of them! Too bad there's no referee&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;the lads here do some "
"really crazy stuff sometimes. So I'll just take a couple more fights and "
"head back to my place, if you don't mind, mate."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_hob"
msgstr ""
"Knabe is a force to be reckoned with. He once pulled five tanks out of the "
"mud with his bare hands and hardly broke a sweat! As a tank commander, he "
"leads his team to victory&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;even if the team actively resists."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_kharlamov"
msgstr ""
"A skilled veteran with international experience, Kharlamov is a leader any "
"crew could dream of."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_maeve"
msgstr ""
"The embodiment of sheer power and a role model for girls around the globe, "
"she's got an unbreakable body and spirit."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_marina"
msgstr ""
"No matter what vehicle she controls, Marie LeGrand is a true menace who "
"leads her crew to dominance in battle."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_nansen"
msgstr ""
"Life, to me, is the greatest of all games. The danger lies in treating it as a trivial game, a game to be taken lightly, and a game in which the rules don't matter much. The rules matter a great deal. The game has to be played fairly, or it is no game at all. Have you not succeeded? Continue! Have you succeeded? Continue! The time to prepare for your next expedition is when you have just returned from a successful trip.\n"
"\n"
"*Based on quotes by Ernest&nbsp;Shackleton, Fridtjof&nbsp;Nansen, and Robert&nbsp;Peary."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_natale"
msgstr ""
"If you need a commander to bring that Holiday feel to battle, Angela Di "
"Natale is the go-to expert who will provide just the right amount of "
"fireworks and explosions."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_omelia"
msgstr ""
"Just as we're saying farewell to&nbsp;a&nbsp;messed up 2020, "
"Omelia&nbsp;Hayworth is joining the ranks of World of Tanks commanders, "
"bringing joy and a true holiday spirit. Here's to a happy 2021!"

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_patricia"
msgstr ""
"With a devout heart and a tactician's mind, Palatine Patricia&nbsp;Laserian "
"is a distinguished combatant even among the members of "
"Adepta&nbsp;Sororitas. Her maxim is: \"&zwnbsp;Your training will help you "
"aim the blow, but your faith will make it decisive&zwnbsp;\"."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_pumpkin"
msgstr ""
"He may trick, he may treat. He won't stand for defeat. As a tanker, he's "
"notorious. His sole goal—to be victorious!"

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_quickybaby"
msgstr ""
"QuickyBaby has been a passionate World&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tanks commander since the early days of the game. It's time for the famed content creator to join you in your Garage and lead you to victory!\n"
"His analytical approach to the game and quick wit have earned him an ever-growing community on Twitch and YouTube and make him an excellent commander on the battlefield. Roll out together, wreak havoc, and show your enemies why QuickyBaby still has a great love for the game after all these years."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_rebranding"
msgstr ""
"A brave commander perfectly skilled in the art of tank combat. In his spare "
"time, he studies enemy tactics or plays chess. He does not lose his temper "
"even in the most stressful of situations."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_starlight"
msgstr ""
"Her name speaks for itself. A spotless soul with the purest of intentions "
"and a killer look (literally!). And what a shock it is to realize how "
"different the business of protecting everyone is when you're behind the "
"scenes."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_tolmeron"
msgstr ""
"A Primaris Space Marine, Lieutenant Tolmeron is not as venerable as some "
"veterans of his famed Chapter, but he already has their respect. He is "
"considered to be a bellicose exemplar of justice with unwavering loyalty to "
"his battle brothers. The humility with which he accepts promotions and "
"decorations—and, most of all, the ease with which he earns them—is notable. "
"\"In combat, he moves like a drop of blood sliding down an adamantium plate:"
" quickly, inevitably,\" say the brethren. \"The blood of Sanguinius runs "
"noble in this one. And his battle scars adorn him.\""

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_twitch50"
msgstr ""
"In a way that befits a ninjutsu master, Splinter’s origins are shrouded in "
"mystery. A man who turned into a humanoid rat, or an evolved rodent—yet does"
" it really matter? We all know him as a great warrior, a wise sensei, and a "
"genuinely good person: a loving father to four adoptive sons."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_twitch_ermelinda"
msgstr ""
"A talented junior researcher, Ermelinda's input was crucial for the "
"development of automated tracked sentry units for a hi&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;tech "
"prototype. To test the units' pathfinding and targeting, she fought them in "
"various tanks. Thus the promising physicist also became a tank commander."

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_twitch_mochizuki"
msgstr ""
"Hidden by shadows\n"
"She is right in front of you\n"
"The silent huntress"

msgid "tankman/lore/commander_whiskers"
msgstr ""
"\"Raise your tankards high, me hearties, for today we've danced with the "
"tempest and plundered the spoils of the sea! Let our deeds echo through the "
"winds, for we be the scourge of the ocean, striking fear into the hearts of "
"men! But remember this, me mates: it's not just the strength of our blades "
"that makes us fearsome, but the unyielding spirit that burns within our "
"souls. Aye, we be the masters of our own fate, and as long as the tide "
"flows, our names shall forever be whispered in awe and trepidation upon the "
"seven seas!\""

msgid "tankman/lore/cosm02_Kirk"
msgstr ""
"Be it a starship brimming with advanced technology or an antique tracked "
"vehicle with an internal combustion engine, James T. Kirk is a master of "
"bold moves and unorthodox solutions. His charisma—especially when he’s in "
"the commander’s chair—motivates his crew to succeed against improbable odds."

msgid "tankman/lore/cosm02_McCoy"
msgstr ""
"While he is not a physicist (or a bricklayer), Leonard \"Bones\" McCoy is an"
" accomplished physician and a dedicated crew member who can be trusted to "
"ably fulfill any role. Despite his acerbic streak, the good doctor is a "
"crewmate who can always be relied on. He is quite comfortable in any planet-"
"bound tracked vehicle, far from the darkness and silence of space—and the "
"nasty effects of aviophobia."

msgid "tankman/lore/cosm02_Scotty"
msgstr ""
"Montgomery \"Scotty\" Scott is able to perform any function capably, but he "
"is first and foremost an engineer—or, rather, the engineer: the epitome, the"
" archetype. This is due to his deep understanding of theoretical physics, "
"combined with a pragmatic resourcefulness and a genuine care for his \"wee "
"bairns\", be they warp cores or his fellow crew members."

msgid "tankman/lore/cosm02_Spock"
msgstr ""
"Commanding officer, first mate, chief scientist—irrespective of his "
"position, Spock is a specialist of exemplary efficiency. His composure even "
"during red alerts, coupled with a strong sense of duty and unwavering "
"loyalty to his shipmates, make Spock an invaluable member of any crew "
"fortunate enough to have him."

msgid "tankman/lore/cosm02_Sulu"
msgstr ""
"An exemplary helmsman, Hikaru Sulu also excels at fencing and skydiving from"
" orbit. Because he’s so modest, it’s impossible to guess how long the full "
"list of his skills is."

msgid "tankman/lore/cosm02_Uhura"
msgstr ""
"A child prodigy who blossomed into an outstanding linguistics and "
"communications specialist, Nyota Uhura also demonstrates impressive command "
"skills thanks to her natural eloquence. She is able to establish a perfect "
"understanding with any crew and contribute to the success of any enterprise."

msgid "tankman/lore/default_lore_descr"
msgstr "@ some text for future "

msgid "tankman/lore/desertRat"
msgstr ""
"Many brave tankers fought for the British Army's 7th Armoured Division in "
"the famous North Africa campaign that won them the affectionate nickname "
"\"Desert Rats\". But none earned that name quite like Len Burrows, the soft-"
"spoken English ace who would lead days-long assaults on enemy positions with"
" no sleep and come back with barely a bolt loose on his tank. It was as if "
"he were born for the dunes: the blistering heat seemed to focus his mind, "
"the incessant sandstorms to sharpen his aim. In the heat of those desert "
"clashes, under the blazing sun, Len blazed his own trail of glory."

msgid "tankman/lore/fisherman"
msgstr ""
"Grew up where the air's thick enough to chew, and the gators are always "
"watchin' your every move. My old man taught me to cast a line 'fore I could "
"read, and I spent most my days on his beat-up boat, pullin' bass and catfish"
" from waters full o' teeth. Ain't much room for fear out there, I tell ya. "
"Now they got me drivin' a steel beast instead, and truth be told, it ain't "
"all that different. Still takes steady hands, sharp eyes, and nerves tough "
"as ol' leather. I ain't no hero, mind. Just a swamp man doin' his part, same"
" as always."

msgid "tankman/lore/frontman"
msgstr ""
"Name's Marshall Gunn—frontman turned tank commander. I lit up stages, burned"
" bridges, and woke up in warzones long before I ever saw a battlefield. "
"Lived hard and crashed harder until life on the road damn near swallowed me "
"whole. When the band split and the music faded, I swapped my six-string for "
"sixty tons of heavy metal. No more cheering crowds or sold-out stadiums—just"
" mayhem and smoke, followed by a silence that's loud enough to drown out the"
" demons of my past. If the devil wants his due, he knows exactly where to "
"find me."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_akaboshi"
msgstr ""
"Typically in command of the Panther Ausf.G., Koume supports Erika with her "
"considerable experience in Sensha-Dō matches."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_aki"
msgstr ""
"Despite her small size—and Mika's cryptic instructions—Aki is a highly adept"
" Loader and Gunner."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_akiyama"
msgstr ""
"As a child, she had trouble making friends because of her obsession with "
"tanks. Highly skilled at espionage, Yukari infiltrated the school ship of "
"Saunders University High School disguised as a student to learn about their "
"strategy for the upcoming match."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_alice"
msgstr ""
"A true prodigy, Alice is a masterful Commander whose vast experience belies "
"her young age. Despite her shy demeanour, she is a real menace on the "
"battlefield, employing a bold combat style that favors unpredictable "
"attacks."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_alisa"
msgstr ""
"A little short in stature as well as temper, this high-strung Vice-Commander"
" considers intelligence-gathering on rival teams her favorite tactic. She "
"has no qualms about bending the rules of Sensha-Dō if it means securing "
"victory. So much so that she often gets chewed out by Kei when she gets "
"caught."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_anna"
msgstr ""
"An all-rounder who is capable of crewing multiple vehicles, as well as a "
"pro-wrestling enthusiast."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_assam"
msgstr ""
"Assam is an excellent Gunner at St. Gloriana Girls' College. She excels in "
"gathering and analyzing information and supports the team as a strategist. "
"Like Darjeeling, she seems to enjoy jokes."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_caesar"
msgstr ""
"The ambitious and hard-working loader of Team-Kabasan. She is deeply "
"proficient in Roman history—she even took on the name of famous Roman "
"Emperor Julius Caesar. She is the heart of the team and provides support for"
" commander Erwin."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_cranberry"
msgstr ""
"Cranberry is a trigger-happy member of St. Gloriana Girls' College. While "
"skilled at making Scotch eggs, she dislikes cooking in general and tired of "
"her teammates constantly asking her to make them."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_darjeeling"
msgstr ""
"A lover of tea with an aristocratic air, Darjeeling never fails to add a "
"touch of class to the battlefield. Well-read and well-spoken, she has a "
"knack for finding the right words for any situation. Now she is training "
"Orange Pekoe with great care, as Darjeeling sees Pekoe as her successor."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_emi"
msgstr ""
"Emmi commands Kuromorimine's Jagdpanther—just don't make her change its "
"excessively heavy tracks."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_emma"
msgstr ""
"Known as the Maus Commander, a bitter defeat made Emma see the importance of"
" maneuverability, rather than just sheer power."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_erika"
msgstr ""
"Kuromorimine's new Commander after Maho left for Germany, Erika is stern and"
" prideful—but she cares deeply for her team."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_erwin"
msgstr ""
"The commander of Team-Kabasan, Erwin took her name from a prominent German "
"World War II commander. Knowledgeable about tank warfare, she is known for "
"her unwavering determination and decisive leadership."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_isuzu"
msgstr ""
"In keeping with family tradition, she practiced Ikebana, the Japanese art of"
" flower arrangement. Later on, she decided to take up "
"Sensha&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;Dō. After joining the tankery team, Hana started off "
"as the driver before switching to gunner."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_kei"
msgstr ""
"With her extraverted personality and impeccable sense of fair play, Kei is "
"the playful yet skilled commander of Saunders University High School's "
"Sensha-Dō team. She is the spiritual pillar of the team, and helps her "
"teammates remember that victory tastes sweeter when it's served with a "
"generous helping of fun."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_mika"
msgstr ""
"The mysterious Commander of Jatkosota's Sensha-Dō team, she is very fond of "
"her trademark tulip hat and kantele."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_mikko"
msgstr ""
"An outstanding Driver, Mikko's skills are essential to Jatkosota High "
"School's unorthodox strategies."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_naomi"
msgstr ""
"This gum-chewing sharpshooter is too cool for school... unless, of course, "
"that school has a Sensha-Dō team! Naomi may be calmer and more introverted "
"than some of her teammates, but her skill with a gun is an immense threat to"
" any opponent."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_nishizumi"
msgstr ""
"A young progeny of the legendary Sensha&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;Dō family. Thanks to"
" her skills as a commander, she saved Ōarai Girls Academy from being closed "
"by winning the national tournament with victories over Saunders, Anzio, "
"Pravda, and Kuromorimine."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_orange"
msgstr ""
"Orange Pekoe is a first-year student at St. Gloriana Girls' College. As a "
"Loader, she handles the loading of shells with precision. Recently, she has "
"been actively making suggestions to Darjeeling, as she has been chosen to be"
" the team's next captain."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_oryou"
msgstr ""
"A member of Team-Kabasan and a known expert on the Bakumatsu period of "
"Japan—the final years before the fall of the Shogunate. Embracing the "
"heritage of Oryō, wife of the prominent restorationist Sakamoto Ryōma, she "
"is calm and focused on driving her StuG III Kaba to victory."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_peach"
msgstr ""
"A capable player with an easygoing air, Peach is often a calming influence "
"on her Gloriana teammates. While she dreams of working overseas after "
"graduation, for now she's completely focused on Sensha-Dō."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_reizei"
msgstr ""
"The top student of Ōarai Girls Academy despite a questionable attendance "
"record, Mako became an exceptional tank driver just by skimming through the "
"manual for a few seconds. Mako is scared of heights, ghosts, and her cranky "
"grandmother."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_rosehip"
msgstr ""
"Gloriana's self-proclaimed \"queen of speed\", Rosehip may enjoy life in the"
" fast lane a little too much. What she lacks in grace, she makes up for in "
"dedication: once she sets her sights on a goal, Rosehip will stop at nothing"
" to achieve it."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_rukuriri"
msgstr ""
"A skilled member of Gloriana's Sensha-Dō team who favors front-line attacks,"
" Rukuriri wears her heart on her sleeve—but her hot-headed approach to "
"battles is often at odds with the more refined traditions of her school."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_saemonza"
msgstr ""
"A fan of the Sengoku period of Japan, Team-Kabasan's gunner took the name of"
" Sanada Yukimura, embracing the heritage of the samurai with all her heart. "
"She is always on alert, poised to strike like an arrow, aiming the mighty "
"gun of her StuG III Kaba just as she would a bow."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_saunders"
msgstr ""
"A member of the Saunders Sensha-Dō team who usually operates in the M4A1 "
"Sherman, commanded by Alisa. She's low-key getting tired of being caught in "
"the crossfire of Alisa's occasional outbursts—and sitting through her rants "
"about her frequent heartbreaks."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_takebe"
msgstr ""
"A member of the Sensha&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;Dō team. Cheerful and talkative, "
"Saori takes her duties quite seriously. Skilled at communication, she also "
"passed a radio operator exam in her spare time. A "
"self&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;proclaimed expert in the art of love and romance, she "
"hopes to continue Sensha&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;Dō and find a cute boyfriend."

msgid "tankman/lore/girls_und_panzer_vanilla"
msgstr ""
"Strong-willed and short-tempered, Vanilla is a skilled player who tries her "
"hardest to bring a touch of refinement to the Gloriana team—with mixed "
"results."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw19_commander1"
msgstr ""
"A unique crew member received during the Mirny&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;13 event."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw19_commander2"
msgstr ""
"A unique crew member received during the Mirny&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;13 event."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw19_commander3"
msgstr ""
"A unique crew member received during the Mirny&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;13 event."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw19_commander4"
msgstr ""
"A unique crew member received during the Mirny&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;13 event."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw19_commander5"
msgstr ""
"A unique crew member received during the Mirny&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;13 event."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw21_commander1"
msgstr ""
"Few can boast such a track record and this number of awards. However, his "
"comrades note that he is a very controversial character. On the one hand, he"
" is a professional the likes of which you'll never meet. On the other, he is"
" a very hard person to talk to. His methods can cause total confusion, but "
"they are always effective."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw21_commander2"
msgstr ""
"During his years of service in the armored corps, he turned into a seasoned "
"veteran who his glorious ancestors would be proud of. In training, he "
"primarily relies on his extensive experience instead of impartial paragraphs"
" from textbooks."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw21_commander4"
msgstr ""
"Having been in many conflict zones, he managed not to lose his kindness, nor"
" his sense of humor, and become a father for young soldiers. His wit, "
"intuition, and a sense of duty often helped him out of seemingly desperate "
"situations, and now Lopakhin shares his knowledge with the cadets."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw21_commander5"
msgstr ""
"A very valuable specialist, who has a huge number of tank battles with "
"various opponents behind his back. He is irreplaceable when training new "
"personnel. He believes that the best award for a soldier is not another "
"government medal, but a successfully completed mission with minimal losses."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw22_tailrius"
msgstr ""
"Pet him without permission, and you risk easily losing an arm. Caudamius "
"considers himself a wild cat who came to humans of his own volition and now "
"lives among them as equals. Thanks to his tough character, he does a great "
"job as the radio operator for his crew of witches. In fact, his hearing "
"alone can detect enemies at vast distances."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw22_witch_aurelia"
msgstr ""
"After graduating from the magic academy, Aurelia&nbsp;von&nbsp;Alden "
"surprised everyone when she decided not to return to her ancestral home. "
"Instead, she set off to join the crew of the legendary Hammer tank and "
"protect the world against otherworldly threats. Still, this witch tank "
"loader is perfectly prim and proper, and, of course, always on time."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw22_witch_deirdra"
msgstr ""
"As a young witch, Deirdre suffered the early loss of her mother. She was "
"then raised by her father, the famous master Holgrim the&nbsp;Iron, designer"
" of the legendary Hammer witch tank. Dei loves machines, speed, and cookies."
" Her cheerful and active nature helps her to get out of extremely difficult "
"combat situations while always managing to boost the morale of the entire "
"crew."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw22_witch_kordelia"
msgstr ""
"After starting her tour of duty as a driver in the tank forces, "
"Cordelia&nbsp;Astra's leadership qualities quickly propelled her into the "
"position of commander. As a seasoned veteran of numerous military campaigns,"
" Cordelia is responsible, calm, and tough-minded. To Cordelia, her tank crew"
" is her family, and she will never abandon her family, no matter the "
"situation."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw22_witch_sibilla"
msgstr ""
"Impulsive and explosive, this fire witch hates all things boring and "
"mundane. As the youngest member of the crew, she is loved and cared for, and"
" her antics often go unpunished. In battle, however, Sybill's hot-headedness"
" plays an important role that makes her a vital part of the crew."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw24_commander1"
msgstr ""
"Norman was never exactly known for his conversation skills, and prolonged "
"exposure to Mirium made him even more taciturn. Nevertheless, his dedication"
" to his duty is unwavering, and he's helped his Squad out of tough "
"situations on more than one occasion."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw24_commander2"
msgstr ""
"Robert is a seasoned veteran whose entire existence has become intertwined "
"with exploration of the Mirium subspace. Despite the clear risks the matter "
"poses to his and his Squad's health, he can no longer imagine life without "
"regular forays into ever-deeper phases."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw24_commander4"
msgstr ""
"Despite the Mirium-induced horrors he has witnessed as part of the Recon "
"Squad, Pyotr remains a calming influence and a father figure for younger "
"troops. Extensive contact with the matter may have forced him to recuperate "
"for a while, but it didn't dampen his spirit and his good nature."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw24_commander5"
msgstr ""
"Elias' normally sharp wit and quick thinking may have been blunted somewhat "
"after spending too long in the Mirium subspace, but after a rehabilitation "
"period he's ready to venture back into its depths—and his vast experience "
"and calmness under pressure mean he remains invaluable to his Squad."

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_DaKun_CN"
msgstr ""
"作为首席战术研究员，大坤在巴比伦事件中凭借战场动态预判能力带领小队突围。其随身携带的改造版“实验记录仪”可实时解析敌方弱点，并通过加密频道向车组播报战术指令。因长期接触异常能量体，其听觉神经变异获得声波成像能力，能穿透战场迷雾标记高危目标，但代价是间歇性幻听——表现为突然插入冷笑话的广播杂讯。"

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_LuJun_CN"
msgstr ""
"作为同盟组织的精英坦克手，陆军在巴比伦銤元素污染灾难中幸存，成为少数未被完全腐化的“人类火炬”。他凭借顶尖的战场直觉和个人号召力，带领小队突破次元裂隙，对抗被銤元素同化的怪物坦克。"

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_Mailand"
msgstr ""
"Operative Mailand returns from thrilling encounters within Mirium-infused "
"steel beasts, overcoming each challenge with precise German accuracy. "
"Equipped with strategic insights and battle-tested techniques, he's ready to"
" share his expert tips and help you become a top-tier tanker. Join Mailand "
"to refine your tactics and take down the opposition!"

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_MouzAkrobat"
msgstr ""
"Operative mouzAkrobat has faced some mysterious dangers over his journey to "
"the Babylon anomaly. Now armed with valuable and unique tactical skills and "
"battle-honed experience, this German commander returns to guide you toward "
"absolute dominance on the battlefield. Elevate your tanking skills to new "
"heights with mouzAkrobat!"

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_Panchezhang_CN"
msgstr ""
"他在混乱中始终保持古井不波的战术心态，当队友因未知恐惧陷入慌乱时，他总能以“换个角度看战局，废墟里也能找掩体”的从容话术稳定军心，其丰富的实战经验与大口径坦克信仰，使他在战斗中屡次以极限操作逆转战局。"

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_Quickybaby"
msgstr ""
"Operative QuickyBaby survived the mysterious forces of Mirium and emerged "
"stronger than ever as a true hero. Armed with firsthand insights and battle-"
"proven wisdom, he leads the charge, showing exactly what it takes to become "
"a formidable tank commander. Join him to sharpen your skills and dominate "
"the battlefield!"

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_Skill4ltu"
msgstr ""
"Operative Skill4ltu has completed several missions deep within the Mirium "
"subspace, having faced its most challenging threats without flinching. Now "
"he's back—armed with invaluable battlefield insights and refined tactical "
"wisdom—and ready to share his expertise to help you become a truly "
"unstoppable commander. With Skill4ltu at your side, the road to victory is "
"yours to pave!"

msgid "tankman/lore/hw25_Titi_CN"
msgstr ""
"作为前线战术指挥官，她凭借硬核实力和天生的战场直觉，驾驶坦克为队友撤离断后，并在銤元素污染中幸存。当巴比伦次元裂隙扩大，她将带领小队深入污染区，成为首批深入污染区的女车长。"

msgid "tankman/lore/jager_mailand"
msgstr ""
"Jäger Mailand joins the ranks, bringing a fresh perspective on the events "
"unfolding across the battlefield. Featuring a unique voice-over and a bold "
"new look, Mailand adds a distinctive touch to your battles."

msgid "tankman/lore/jager_mouzakrobat"
msgstr ""
"Jäger MouzAkrobat joins the ranks, bringing a distinctive style and outlook "
"to the battlefield. Featuring a unique voice-over, MouzAkrobat makes every "
"encounter a little more memorable."

msgid "tankman/lore/john_christmas"
msgstr ""
"Not many people know this, but when Santa’s got too much on his plate, he "
"sometimes outsources certain important jobs to his extended family. His "
"nephew, John, is the head of the family tank division. Unlike his uncle, "
"John shuns the limelight, preferring instead to work behind the scenes with "
"his crack team of delivery elves. They tell him some tankers have been "
"naughty this year, but John knows that, really, everyone’s been nice. So "
"when the snow begins to fall and the Holiday Ops Village lights up, it's "
"John Christmas's time to shine."

msgid "tankman/lore/lunar26_commander"
msgstr ""
"A natural commander, Jin Guiying carries herself with unwavering authority, "
"yet she never lets it get in the way of building strong camaraderie among "
"her crew. Never one to sit still for long, she feels most at home in the "
"field, where her sharp eye for terrain and talent for practical tactics are "
"put to full use. Lively and quick-witted, she meets every challenge with an "
"infectious energy that keeps morale high."

msgid "tankman/lore/men2_text_usa"
msgstr ""
"A crew member of the Fury, the heroic tank from the movie of the same name, "
"based on the American M4A2."

msgid "tankman/lore/men2_text_ussr"
msgstr ""
"One of the characters from the Polish TV series Four&nbsp;Tankmen "
"and&nbsp;a&nbsp;Dog, and a crew member of the Rudy tank."

msgid "tankman/lore/menS21Commander"
msgstr ""
"The lead singer of Sabaton, who connects with his audience masterfully. With"
" his unwavering vocal prowess and distinctive onstage looks, he is one of "
"the most recognizable frontmen of our time."

msgid "tankman/lore/menS21Driver"
msgstr ""
"Sabaton's guitar player, who attacks the guitar like it owes him money and "
"adds even more fire to an already epic show."

msgid "tankman/lore/menS21Gunner"
msgstr ""
"The drummer behind the iconic, inspiring marching rhythm of most Sabaton "
"songs."

msgid "tankman/lore/menS21Loader"
msgstr ""
"An eye&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;catching Viking in the flesh, Sabaton's guitarist "
"adds a touch of Nordic tenacity to every song."

msgid "tankman/lore/menS21Radioman"
msgstr ""
"Sabaton's actual founding father, a bassist who perfectly combines music and"
" management skills."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Beijing_Opera"
msgstr ""
"A crew member dressed like a Beijing&nbsp;opera actor. This is one of the "
"most famous forms of Chinese traditional opera both in China and around the "
"world."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Buffon"
msgstr ""
"A world&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;famous goalkeeper who perfectly understands both "
"tactics and teamwork. His skills and experience will come in handy in any "
"combat situation."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Buffon_Football"
msgstr ""
"A world&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;famous goalkeeper who perfectly understands both "
"tactics and teamwork. His skills and experience will come in handy in any "
"combat situation."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Edelweiss"
msgstr ""
"A crew member of the Edelweiss tank, a combat vehicle from the Japanese "
"video game, manga, and anime Valkyria&nbsp;Chronicles."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Loza"
msgstr ""
"A Soviet tank ace and the Hero&nbsp;of&nbsp;the Soviet Union. Under his "
"command, the 1st Tank Battalion of the 46th Guards Tank Brigade played a "
"critical role in the battle for Vienna in 1945."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Nameless"
msgstr ""
"A crew member of the Nameless tank, a combat vehicle from the Japanese video"
" game, manga, and anime Valkyria&nbsp;Chronicles."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Offspring_Commander"
msgstr ""
"The lead singer, guitar player, and songwriter is a modern-day Renaissance "
"Man! He has a Ph.D. in Molecular Biology, makes Gringo Bandito Hot Sauce, "
"and he is a real-life jet pilot! The rest of the crew remains uncertain "
"whether those aircraft skills will transfer to an intense tank battle "
"though."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Offspring_Driver"
msgstr ""
"The band's drummer. Dozing off to his metronome may prove hazardous to "
"health. Tick&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;tock&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;tick&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;bang!"
" Tick&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;tock&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;tick&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;blam! "
"However, when driving, he makes no sudden moves. Any break in rhythm is "
"considered incompetence for a drummer."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Offspring_Gunner"
msgstr ""
"The lead guitarist attacks his instrument with a mixture of anger, sheer "
"joy, and reckless abandon. As with every great guitarist and gunner, Noodles"
" knows you have to take chances and give it 100% in order to hit just the "
"right notes."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_Offspring_Loader"
msgstr ""
"The bass guitarist who skillfully and passionately both loads shells and "
"immerses thousands of fans in a breathtaking atmosphere during the "
"performance. His endless positive energy and punk vibes raise the morale of "
"the entire crew to the highest level."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_race19_commanderA"
msgstr ""
"One of the participants of The Great Race, an excellent driver, and a "
"talented Instructor. Speed is in his veins, which is why he always requires "
"quick reactions from his recruits."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_race19_commanderA_en"
msgstr ""
"One of the participants of The Great Race, an excellent driver, and a "
"talented Instructor. Speed is in his veins, which is why he always requires "
"quick reactions from his recruits."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_race19_commanderB"
msgstr ""
"One of the participants of The Great Race, an excellent driver, and a "
"talented Instructor. As a tireless experimenter, he's always teaching fresh "
"ideas and innovative solutions to his recruits."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_race19_commanderB_en"
msgstr ""
"One of the participants of The Great Race, an excellent driver, and a "
"talented Instructor. As a tireless experimenter, he's always teaching fresh "
"ideas and innovative solutions to his recruits."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_race19_commanderC"
msgstr ""
"One of the participants of The Great Race, an excellent driver, and a "
"talented Instructor. He always trains his cadets based on examples from his "
"personal experience."

msgid "tankman/lore/men_race19_commanderC_en"
msgstr ""
"One of the participants of The Great Race, an excellent driver, and a "
"talented Instructor. He always trains his cadets based on examples from his "
"personal experience."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny19_girl_L10"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2019."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny19_girl_L4"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2019."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny19_girl_L6"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2019."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny19_girl_L8"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2019."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny19_men"
msgstr ""
"\"Any of you players feel sad, and I swear I'll congratulate every last one "
"of you!\""

msgid "tankman/lore/ny20_girl_Christmas"
msgstr ""
"One of the Snow Maidens and the mascot for the Christmas Collection. Awarded"
" during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2020."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny20_girl_Fairytale"
msgstr ""
"One of the Snow Maidens and the mascot for the Magic Collection. Awarded "
"during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2020."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny20_girl_NewYear"
msgstr ""
"One of the Snow Maidens and the mascot for the New Year Collection. Awarded "
"during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2020."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny20_girl_Oriental"
msgstr ""
"One of the Snow Maidens and the mascot for the Lunar Collection. Awarded "
"during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2020."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny20_men"
msgstr ""
"You better watch out. You better not cry. You better not pout, I'm telling "
"you why: Stefan Clause is handling your tank."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny20_men_eu"
msgstr "A unique crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2020."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny20_snowmen"
msgstr ""
"\"...And I will strike down upon thee with great kindness and wholesome "
"gifts those who behaved themselves last year. And you will know my name is "
"Holiday when I lay my kindness upon thee.&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/ny21_girl_1"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2021."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny21_girl_2"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2021."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny21_girl_3"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2021."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny21_girl_4"
msgstr "A female crew member awarded during Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2021."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny21_men"
msgstr ""
"\"Some of you may wonder how many languages Chuck can speak. Come on, Chuck "
"doesn't study foreign languages. Foreign languages study Chuck.&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/ny22_girl_1"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2022. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny22_girl_2"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2022. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny22_girl_3"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2022. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny22_girl_4"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2022. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny22_men"
msgstr ""
"Dear players! Yes, this is Arnold Schwarzenegger, and we are very aware of how long you have been asking us to add him to the game. We are thrilled that we managed to cooperate with him and bring you such exciting news. Arnie promised to be back many times, and now he is with us. We hope that you will give him a warm welcome and select your best and favorite tank for him.\n"
"\n"
"World of Tanks Development Team"

msgid "tankman/lore/ny22_men_A"
msgstr ""
"\"Well, well... Again, you are complaining about a 152 mm shell hitting a "
"light tank without causing damage? Let me personally take command of one of "
"your vehicles and prove in battle that it's fine. If you need cold facts, "
"the reason is... (a long monologue in dev language).&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/ny23_girl_1"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2023. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny23_girl_2"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2023. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny23_girl_3"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2023. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny23_girl_4"
msgstr ""
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during "
"Holiday&nbsp;Ops&nbsp;2023. The female crew member has the Brothers&nbsp;in "
"Arms perk trained to 100% and enough experience to train one additional perk"
" to 100%."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny23_girl_m"
msgstr ""
"Her dashing beauty, undeniable talent, and unique, contagious laugh are "
"Milla's unwavering companions on her victory marches down the red carpet. "
"And the next time you catch her on the silver screen, you will likely "
"remember the words of the scientist from Milla's most beloved movie: "
"\"&zwnbsp;I told you ... perfect!&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/ny23ruby_girl_1"
msgstr ""
"Her dashing beauty, undeniable talent, and unique, contagious laugh are "
"Milla's unwavering companions on her victory marches down the red carpet. "
"And the next time you catch her on the silver screen, you will likely "
"remember the words of the scientist from Milla's most beloved movie: "
"\"&zwnbsp;I told you ... perfect!&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/ny24_girl_1"
msgstr ""
"Alba is a promising archeologist who discovered a glowing blue crystal during one of her expeditions. The crystal eventually turned out to be Rock Crystal, used widely within the Holiday Ops events.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2024."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny24_girl_2"
msgstr ""
"Pure Emerald is a rare resource mined in the Himalayan mountains. As an experienced miner, Shuangya is now leading all main excavation work, securing a constant flow of Emerald.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2024."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny24_girl_3"
msgstr ""
"Gwenyth is a devoted traveler who must have been to all four corners of the earth in her pursuit for Warm Amber — a yellow mineral that can be found in the most unexpected places.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2024."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny24_girl_4"
msgstr ""
"A talented scientist, Elsa has spent hours, months, and even years studying Meteoric Iron and unraveling its mysterious secrets.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2024."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny24_men"
msgstr ""
"Vinnie worked for Santa for decades, handling the naughty list. But times "
"have changed. Now, he has settled in World of Tanks, where he has everything"
" he likes: high-caliber guns, sturdy vehicles, and stunning explosions. But "
"don't get too comfortable, as he might just come by on Christmas Eve and "
"check whether you've been nice this year. So just...be nice."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny25_girl_1"
msgstr ""
"It's a good thing Emily has excellent time management skills, because she may just have the most demanding job in the world: making sure Santa receives—and reads—the millions of letters sent to him every year, then sourcing the millions of presents to match!\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2025."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny25_girl_2"
msgstr ""
"Mince pies, gingerbread, candy canes, Yule log; Christmas wouldn't be Christmas without the treats we all love. Luckily, with Ramsey Zhang heading up Santa's elite kitchen team, there's no danger of any sweet shortages any time soon.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2025."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny25_girl_3"
msgstr ""
"Ever wondered how Santa and his team of reindeer manage to travel to every country in the world in just 24 hours? It's because he has Vanessa around to keep them—and him—in peak physical condition with a rigorous training program, all year round.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2025."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny25_girl_4"
msgstr ""
"Without someone to take care of the technical side of things, Santa's Christmas operations would quite literally fall apart. Fortunately for him, Astrid is an expert mechanic who keeps his sleigh operating at the peak of its powers, whatever the weather.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2025."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny25_men"
msgstr ""
"All-action tough guy? Possibly. Cold-blooded enforcer? Perhaps. Street-smart"
" purveyor of worldly wisdom? Yeah, you could say that. A man of many roles "
"and even more talents, Jason has now been tasked with his most demanding "
"duty yet: running the show in Holiday Ops 2025. Luckily, he knows his way "
"around an armored vehicle, and he definitely isn't afraid of the odd "
"explosion. It's best to get him recruited to your crew ASAP because, "
"well...let's just say you don't want to be on his naughty list."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny26_girl_1"
msgstr ""
"With her effortless style and radiant smile, Natalie lives up to her name by bringing some sparkle to every party. A thoughtful listener who delights in heartfelt conversation, she embodies the spirit of the season—leaving everyone she speaks to with a warm, cozy feeling inside.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2026."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny26_girl_2"
msgstr ""
"If you're throwing a Christmas party, then Holly's the person you want to organize it. A social butterfly who's always on her feet, she'll make sure the decorations are dazzling, the atmosphere is immaculate, and everyone's armed with a drink—or three—to get into the festive spirit.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2026."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny26_girl_3"
msgstr ""
"Eva loves winter—the crunch of the snow, the twinkle of the lights, the cozy evenings by the fire. As for Christmas parties, she'd much rather be curled up at home with a good book—but she still makes the time to send warm wishes (and the occasional gingerbread delivery) to her friends.\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2026."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny26_girl_4"
msgstr ""
"Mia is so popular that her guest list is almost as long as Santa’s delivery schedule—but you can bet your baubles she'll be the life of any party, no matter who's attending. When it comes to festive fun, she lives by one golden rule: bigger, brighter, and more fabulous!\n"
"Awarded for reaching a certain Festive Atmosphere Level during Holiday Ops 2026."

msgid "tankman/lore/ny26_men"
msgstr ""
"Do you find, sometimes, that your battles lack a little flair, a little "
"refinement? Enter Commander Cumberbatch. Dangerously charming and impeccably"
" dressed, this legend of the stage and screen will bring a touch of class to"
" any battlefield. With an impressively diverse portfolio of roles, he's a "
"true virtuoso and master of transformation. Expect him to command your "
"vehicle the same way he commands audiences: with trademark panache, "
"devastating English wit, and a few choice words that will hurt enemies even "
"more than your shells."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p3_1"
msgstr ""
"Previously a history teacher in a rural Polish school, Jan answered his "
"country's call to fight back against overwhelming firepower dominance. His "
"fearless leadership on the battlefield, combined with his authoritative "
"beard, led crewmates to nickname him \"Chief\"."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p3_2"
msgstr ""
"Growing up in an influential Swedish military family, Anna was fascinated by"
" blueprints, plans, and prototypes from a young age. After building on her "
"childhood curiosity by studying tank engineering, she now applies her "
"expertise to test high-precision combat equipment—to the great pride of her "
"father."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p3_3"
msgstr ""
"Disillusioned with his studies at an elite art school, Damon rebelled by "
"dropping out to serve Queen and country in the British Armed Forces. "
"Swapping the fine arts for the art of war, he finally discovered his true "
"passion—leaving his oil masterpieces on the battlefield."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p3_4"
msgstr ""
"As an ink master at a Florida tattoo parlor, Andy gained a reputation for "
"being able to talk for hours with anyone about anything. After he enlisted "
"in the military, Andy's infectious charisma found an even more receptive "
"audience, with his natural ability to unite fellow tankers making him the "
"\"Soul\" of his crew."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p4_1"
msgstr ""
"Hailing from the bayous of Louisiana, Captain Elijah \"Gator\" Brooks earned"
" his nickname for his ability to survive and thrive in the toughest of "
"conditions. Growing up near treacherous swamps where few dared to tread, he "
"learned to adapt to any terrain and turn the environment to his "
"advantage—making him a master of battlefield strategy."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p4_2"
msgstr ""
"A Dortmund native, Franz \"Forge\" Köhler is known for his unshakable focus "
"under fire. A former factory worker used to handling heavy metal, he boasts "
"uncanny strength and precision. He approaches targets like machines to "
"dismantle—calculating every move with methodical accuracy—while his shots "
"strike like a hammer on an anvil."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p4_3"
msgstr ""
"As a young delivery boy in the riverlands of Guangdong, Zhang \"Courier\" "
"Wei often found himself sent on long-distance errands to far-off towns. "
"Racing his trusty bicycle across vast plains and weaving through bustling "
"city streets, he developed sharp spatial awareness and lightning-fast "
"reactions—skills he now uses to outwit danger with every turn on the "
"battlefield."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p4_4"
msgstr ""
"Background details remain sparse. Reports suggest previous service in "
"[CLASSIFIED]. Known for unmatched speed and dexterity, \"Phantom\" handles "
"ammunition like a second heartbeat. The ever-present bandana obscures more "
"than a face—it shields secrets no one dares uncover."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p5_1"
msgstr ""
"Aleksander lives life in constant motion: running to the limit, swimming "
"through cold, pushing through obstacles. His approach on the battlefield is "
"no different; a Pole by blood and character, he will lead the charge until "
"his strength gives out. For as long as he can remember, he has had a habit "
"of taking machines apart to see what’s inside, and an uncanny ability to "
"turn heaps of metal into functioning systems. With front-line discipline and"
" a mechanic's meticulousness, he checks every part of every vehicle, knowing"
" that the life of the crew and the next meter of progress depend on it."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p5_2"
msgstr ""
"A dangerous sniper with a keen eye, Natalia keeps the bigger picture in mind"
" even when her sights are trained on her target. Her prodigious vision, "
"though, extends beyond just marksmanship. To the constant amazement of her "
"crewmates, she reads people intuitively, senses their intentions, and "
"manages to make the right choice before others realize there was one to be "
"made. Decisive, brave, and usually silent, she enters combat without a word,"
" but with a relentless focus on the task at hand."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p5_3"
msgstr ""
"A lover of sleep, Aleš can doze just about anywhere: on a dugout floor, on "
"his tank's hull, or even to the \"soothing\" rumble of its engine. He's also"
" a hearty eater who will never pass up the chance to inspect a ration pack. "
"Yet despite his appreciation for the more sedentary side of life, this "
"gregarious giant is a formidable fighter who can lift his crew's spirits "
"with a well-timed joke even in the heat of battle. Outside combat, he "
"treasures time with his young daughter, his greatest motivation to return "
"from every mission."

msgid "tankman/lore/onslaught_p5_4"
msgstr ""
"A musician by training, Eugen has a knack for finding order in chaos. For "
"him, any challenge is something to understand and master, not to shy away "
"from, no matter how complex it may appear. That boundless curiosity means "
"he'll never say no to even the most daunting of tasks, but he doesn't leap "
"in all guns blazing; trusting his instinct and cool head under pressure, he "
"listens, analyzes, then moves with the rhythm of the battlefield while "
"others continue to hesitate."

msgid "tankman/lore/oow21_strategist_commander"
msgstr ""
"An \"old-school\" officer. Cold-blooded and prudent, he makes decisions "
"quickly but without rush. He understands the great cost that even the "
"tiniest planning mistake may cause."

msgid "tankman/lore/oow21_tanker_1_commander"
msgstr ""
"A graduate of the Royal Military Academy. He was a military translator who "
"participated in many military actions around the world, picking up "
"experience in operation planning and combat."

msgid "tankman/lore/oow21_tanker_2_commander"
msgstr ""
"A seasoned procurement and logistics officer. He can build the most "
"effective routes while taking frontline military needs into consideration. "
"He believes that well-conducted logistics support is key to winning any "
"battle."

msgid "tankman/lore/oow21_tanker_3_commander"
msgstr ""
"An experienced tank commander and scout. He participates in military "
"discussions, drawing attention to the terrain's specifics and the enemy's "
"locations that are not specified on military maps."

msgid "tankman/lore/oow21_tanker_4_commander"
msgstr ""
"A military engineer who can cross any terrain and break through any "
"fortification. Simply build a pontoon bridge, find a breach in the enemy's "
"defensive lines—and outflank them and strike them down."

msgid "tankman/lore/polish_commander"
msgstr ""
"Cygan is a dynamic Polish powerhouse who's not just your average content "
"creator and tournament caster—he's also a seasoned World of Tanks virtuoso "
"who'll take your gaming experience to a whole new level as Commander!"

msgid "tankman/lore/rudy_tankman_commander"
msgstr ""
"One of the characters from the Polish TV series "
"Four&nbsp;Tankmen&nbsp;and&nbsp;a Dog, and a crew member of the Rudy tank. "
"He can be strict, but on the whole, he is a funny young man who had to grow "
"up fast at war."

msgid "tankman/lore/rudy_tankman_driver"
msgstr ""
"One of the characters from the Polish TV series "
"Four&nbsp;Tankmen&nbsp;and&nbsp;a Dog, and a crew member of the Rudy tank. "
"He is a smart and tough-minded tanker with incredible strength. He always "
"prefers making calculated decisions instead of acting rashly."

msgid "tankman/lore/rudy_tankman_gunner"
msgstr ""
"One of the characters from the Polish TV series "
"Four&nbsp;Tankmen&nbsp;and&nbsp;a Dog, and a crew member of the Rudy tank."

msgid "tankman/lore/rudy_tankman_loader"
msgstr ""
"One of the characters from the Polish TV series "
"Four&nbsp;Tankmen&nbsp;and&nbsp;a Dog, and a crew member of the Rudy tank. "
"He is an easy-going and prudent tanker who conscientiously fulfills his "
"duty. He doesn't demand extraordinary results from his cadets, but does not "
"tolerate carelessness and laziness."

msgid "tankman/lore/servicewoman"
msgstr ""
"Whatever the assignment, Jadwiga Wołoszyn took it on with poise and "
"diligence. As a proud member of the Polish Women's Auxiliary Service, she "
"became part of a remarkable wartime effort that carried her country's spirit"
" far beyond its borders. Her duties shifted with the needs of the day—at "
"times behind the wheel of a transport truck, at others sorting urgent "
"documents or relaying vital communications via radio, and occasionally in "
"basic weapons instruction. Through it all, women like Jadwiga proved "
"indispensable to the cause."

msgid "tankman/lore/seven_commander"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. Nobody "
"has found a way to destroy him. A tough commander who demands strict "
"discipline."

msgid "tankman/lore/seven_driver"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. He has "
"no rivals in terms of acceleration or top speed to compete with...if he is "
"in good health. Thanks to his abilities, he is a true king of the road."

msgid "tankman/lore/seven_gunner"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. What "
"lies behind his black mask is a complete mystery. Silent, stealthy, and "
"enigmatic, he is a super-powered ninja."

msgid "tankman/lore/seven_loader"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. While on"
" probation, he is ready for any role in the team. He perfectly completes any"
" task under pressure."

msgid "tankman/lore/southpawBoxer"
msgstr ""
"Accomplished boxer Leonard Knox, known to his sparring buddies simply as "
"\"Southpaw\" for his left-handed stance, has been a military history buff "
"since before he put on his first pair of boxing gloves. And that's saying "
"something, considering he started boxing when he still needed a step stool "
"to reach his gym's water fountain. It's no surprise, then, that this "
"lifelong fan of anything that goes boom, smack, or thwack eventually stepped"
" up as a tank commander. Trading the confines of the ring for sprawling "
"battlefields, Lenny punches well above his weight in every fight."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_auc_1"
msgstr ""
"Primaris Techmarine. Fascinated by machines from a very young age, "
"Vitarian's propensity for all things mechanical did not subside when he was "
"elevated to the ranks of the Astartes. He has a specialist's touch and is "
"often able to coax machinery into performing above its standard ability. He "
"is much more at ease communing with machine spirits rather than with his "
"combat fellows. He keeps the company of machinery, ever trying to perfect "
"the holy relationship between man and machine."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_auc_2"
msgstr ""
"6th Company Sgt. Goran is the current commander of the Repulsor Executioner "
"tank. He has a special affinity with the tank's machine spirit, and often "
"applies aggressive flanking maneuvers, using his vehicle's armor to surprise"
" the enemy. Thankfully, his exceptional skill and total lack of fear allow "
"him to perform these kinds of moves without fail."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1002_1"
msgstr ""
"Boris the Blade, AKA the Bullet Dodger, AKA Boris the Butcher. Sound "
"threatening enough? This cold-blooded arms dealer's monikers should tell you"
" all you need to know about him. Boris's past as an undercover agent remains"
" a mystery, but needless to say it molded him into a cool, collected, and "
"highly competent operator. Try not to be the story behind his next nickname."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1002_2"
msgstr ""
"He might have a funny name for an Englishman, but Turkish is a serious "
"fella. Boxing promoter, slot shop owner, and all-round smooth operator, he's"
" the voice of reason when things are going a bit pear-shaped. Armed with a "
"knack for negotiation and a typically dry English sense of humor, Turkish is"
" a man with a plan — and a few choice words — for any situation."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1002_3"
msgstr ""
"\"Bullet\" and \"tooth\" are two words that shouldn't go together. But "
"Bullet-Tooth Tony isn't a man who plays by conventional rules. He's a man "
"who gets shot six times and has the bullets made into gold teeth — hence the"
" name. A seasoned bounty hunter with a penchant for extreme violence, he "
"exudes an almost eerie sense of calm under pressure. Tony's methods may not "
"always be subtle, but you best believe they're effective."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1002_4"
msgstr ""
"Named after a gun — NOT a ballet dancer — Tommy is a wheeler-dealer who's "
"not to be messed with. A connoisseur of caravans and lover of dags, Tommy is"
" always in the right place, but at the wrong time. Or the wrong place, but "
"at the right time. Either way, he's got the minerals to rule the "
"battlefield. At least, that's what he thinks."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1002_5"
msgstr ""
"Four fingers. Yes, that's four, not five. Known to have a soft spot for "
"gambling, this professional gangster and diamond enthusiast once lost a "
"finger in a debt-related misunderstanding. Not that that's stopped him "
"pulling the trigger since, of course. Suave, savvy, and with an impeccable "
"sense of style, Franky Four Fingers is an expert in all things criminal."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1003_1"
msgstr ""
"Trained in the mysterious ways of the Bene Gesserit, Lady Jessica's powers "
"of perception are unparalleled, making her a formidable adversary in any "
"battle of wit or strength. Forced by circumstance to reckon with the "
"survival of the Atreides house, Jessica must now harness all her inner "
"resolve as she embarks on a mission that will determine the fate of the "
"Known Universe."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1004_1"
msgstr ""
"\"Small-town sheriff\"? Some may sneer, but for Will Teasle, there's no "
"higher honor than being the man who maintains the public order in Hope, "
"Washington—and nothing worse than law-breaking drifters like John Rambo. A "
"fiercely territorial enforcer whose pride can spill over into prejudice, "
"Sheriff Teasle will tolerate no disturbance to his town's sleepy "
"northwestern tranquility. And make no mistake: he'll make sure anyone he "
"deems a threat to his authority as sheriff will feel the full force of the "
"law."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1004_2"
msgstr ""
"A smooth talker and accomplished negotiator, Marshall Murdock is a true-blue"
" American dedicated to serving his country and its citizens. Or that's what "
"he'd have you believe, at least. Yet behind Murdock's charming demeanor is a"
" calculating, pragmatic mind that's focused on self-preservation. An expert "
"at manipulating situations to his advantage, Murdock is ready to do whatever"
" it takes to protect his own interests—and it's never quite clear where his "
"loyalties lie."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1004_3"
msgstr ""
"Veteran. Lone wolf. Survivor. Whatever you call him, John James Rambo is a "
"force to be reckoned with. Resilient, resourceful, and extraordinarily "
"powerful, this battle-hardened warrior is the ultimate fighting machine—yet,"
" having seen things no man should, he is tortured by agonizing memories of "
"the horrors of war. While his struggles to return to civilian life may put "
"him at odds with those in authority, Rambo is deeply loyal and wants nothing"
" more than to find peace—both for himself and for those he holds dear."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1004_4"
msgstr ""
"Friend, mentor, and one-time commanding officer to Rambo, Colonel Samuel "
"Trautman is one of the few people who truly understands the troubled former "
"Green Beret. Where others see a merciless soldier conditioned to kill, "
"Trautman sees a tormented soul haunted by unspeakable trauma and in "
"desperate need of guidance and support. A decorated combat veteran himself, "
"Trautman walks a fine line between loyalty to his country and loyalty to his"
" protégé, fighting Rambo's corner when no one else will."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1004_5"
msgstr ""
"Armed with exceptional combat skills and a resourceful mind, Co Bao is a "
"determined freedom fighter committed to the struggle for liberation and a "
"brighter future. But her tough exterior hides a pure heart and a genuine "
"care for the fate of those dear to her. Risking everything to help Rambo, "
"she remains resolute in the face of overwhelming adversity. Compassionate "
"and positive to the last, Co Bao firmly believes that no one, especially not"
" Rambo, is expendable."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1005_1"
msgstr ""
"Santa Claus needs no introduction. What he does need, however, is a break. "
"He’s got a to-do list longer than an elf's overtime sheet and a couple of "
"billion gifts to deliver on a very tight schedule. And now, on top of all "
"that, he’s got a new challenge to contend with: the dastardly scheming of "
"his one-time associate, Charles Krampowski, who has taken it upon himself to"
" ruin Christmas once and for all. Santa, of course, won't stand for it. He "
"might be known for his cheerful demeanor and booming laugh, but he's not "
"going to let anyone spoil the festive season. This year, it's war."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1005_2"
msgstr ""
"Like his origins, Charles Krampowski's motives are shrouded in mystery. A "
"mechanic of undeniable talent, there was a time when he worked shoulder-to-"
"shoulder with Santa, crafting mechanical marvels for the best-behaved "
"tankers. Over time, however, he began to develop a taste for chaos. Now, "
"banished from Santa's workshop and condemned to the naughty list, he's hell-"
"bent on turning festive fun into holiday havoc. The battle for Christmas is "
"beginning, and it's going to get explosive. Whose side are you on?"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1006_1"
msgstr ""
"Once a dedicated Detroit police officer, Alex Murphy was brutally wounded in"
" the line of duty and resurrected as a cybernetically enhanced law "
"enforcement unit known as RoboCop. Engineered by the mega-corporation Omni "
"Consumer Products, RoboCop is outfitted with advanced targeting systems, "
"bulletproof armor, and the prime directive to serve the public trust, "
"protect the innocent, and uphold the law. Even RoboCop himself isn't sure "
"where the man ends and the machine begins. But man or machine, patrol car or"
" tank—it makes no difference. Dead or alive, you're coming with him."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1006_2"
msgstr ""
"Overworked, world-weary, and constantly running damage control, Sergeant "
"Warren Reed's commitment to his city is remarkable. A veteran of Detroit's "
"decaying law enforcement infrastructure, Reed has spent decades holding the "
"thin, frayed blue line. After so many years on the force, he thought he'd "
"seen it all. That was before RoboCop came online. Whether this shiny new "
"addition to the roster turns out to be a breakthrough or a liability, time "
"will tell. Whatever happens, Reed's approach won't change. He'll do what "
"he's always done—his job."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1006_3"
msgstr ""
"Ambitious and sharp-tongued, Bob Morton is a rising star at Omni Consumer "
"Products and the brains behind the RoboCop program. He may not be as overtly"
" villainous as some of his shadier colleagues, but don't let the slick charm"
" fool you—this career-driven opportunist will stop at nothing to climb the "
"corporate ladder. That includes manipulating events behind the scenes and "
"putting Detroit's finest in harm's way to secure the ideal candidate for his"
" cyborg law enforcer. After all, who needs morals when you're swimming in "
"cash? That's how it's done in the big leagues."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1006_4"
msgstr ""
"All it takes is one wary glance at Emil Antonowsky to know exactly who "
"you're dealing with—and how unlucky you are. This slimy denizen of Old "
"Detroit's sprawling criminal underworld lives for the intoxicating rush that"
" only chaos and destruction can bring, and his next hit can never come soon "
"enough. For someone whose hobbies include robbing gas stations and "
"terrorizing cops, Emil somehow manages to carry himself with the swagger of "
"a rock star... if that rock star lived in a sewer and brushed his teeth with"
" motor oil."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1006_5"
msgstr ""
"Anne Lewis is a seasoned field officer with the Detroit Police Department. "
"As Alex Murphy's partner, she was among the first to see the humanity still "
"alive beneath RoboCop's armored exterior. Tough and level-headed, yet "
"grounded by a strong moral compass, Lewis stands firm in a city overrun by "
"violence and corruption. Her loyalty to the badge and relentless drive to do"
" what's right make her a hero in a place that desperately needs one. She's a"
" cop who still believes in serving the public trust, even when the odds are "
"stacked against her."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp1006_6"
msgstr ""
"Violent thug Leon Nash wouldn't know right from wrong if it spit him in the "
"face. Or maybe he just doesn't give a damn. Either way, this trigger-happy "
"member of crime boss Clarence Boddicker's notorious gang is the last guy "
"you'd want to run into on the mean streets of Old Detroit. He's more used to"
" joyriding stolen sports cars than driving tanks, but commanding a "
"bulletproof monster truck on treads—with a massive gun on top, no "
"less—sounds like this loose cannon's idea of a seriously good time."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp10_1"
msgstr ""
"Eighteen years of infantry service did not change this soldier's demeanor at"
" all. He is still a fun and light-hearted hulk of a man who loves to place "
"bets, believes in his luck, and always relies on chance. He got into the "
"desert by flipping a coin&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;what else is there to say? His "
"carelessness got him into mortal danger several times, but he always got "
"away unscathed. His catchphrase is \"&zwnbsp;Betcha I'll come back "
"alive.&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp10_2"
msgstr ""
"A military translator who can quickly adapt to the specifics of any military"
" branch. A polyglot who knows eight languages, including Swahili. After the "
"passing of his comrade in arms, Leo&nbsp;Sommer, he keeps to himself, which "
"is why he prefers to work alone and not to make new friends. While working "
"in the archives, he found a mention of an ancient scroll that was considered"
" lost, and not a week later, he was a part of a special desert expedition."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp10_3"
msgstr ""
"Only three people have access to this spy's personal file. According to some"
" info, she is the daughter of an intel officer and an actress. She was "
"recruited at a young age and is considered the best in covert operations. In"
" addition to her remarkable wits, she also makes active use of her good "
"looks. She was sent to the desert by the order of higher commanding "
"officers, but she never wanted to go there."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp11_1"
msgstr ""
"A son of an Australian Army officer who rarely received praise from his "
"father, which made him a perfectionist in everything since childhood. He is "
"an outgoing person, considered to be a go-to guy by his friends, even though"
" he can be annoyingly diligent, always following army regulations to the "
"letter. He is a bit narcissistic, but he will never admit it to anyone—not "
"even himself."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp11_2"
msgstr ""
"Colette grew up in the countryside and knows first-hand what hard work "
"is&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;and also how to throw a party. She never tried to be "
"feminine or delicate, and if she ever goes anywhere with a handbag, it is "
"only to conceal her Ruby pistol. She defies established rules and always "
"speaks her mind, which is why she is still a lieutenant. However, as long as"
" she remains in command of her crew, she does not seem to care."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp11_3"
msgstr ""
"He does not look like a hard-boiled commander. He does not need glory, "
"recognition, or awards. Even so, Adaškevič always performs his missions with"
" the utmost responsibility. He is not used to sharing his plans, especially "
"considering they are coming to life exactly the opposite: A true patriot of "
"his country, he is forced to serve away from his fatherland, and his only "
"friend recently went missing on a mission that was supposed to last eight "
"hours. In moments of desperation, Stefan unknowingly hums his favorite song "
"about red poppies, even though his voice is not like it used to be anymore."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp11_4"
msgstr ""
"A brilliant student and a very creative person. She never misses an "
"opportunity to do things by herself, knowing full well that her initiative "
"will not go unpunished. She taught herself several languages (including "
"Italian) and finished a special crypto radio operators class with flying "
"colors. She is married, but she does not like to discuss her personal life."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_1"
msgstr ""
"A German tankman. He is equally at home as a combat vehicle commander and an"
" inquisitive scientist. Since high school, he has been drawn to the natural "
"sciences and has an excellent understanding of chemistry, biology, and "
"physics. He constantly keeps a journal in which he records everything in the"
" form of indecipherable notes and rather visual illustrations."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_10"
msgstr ""
"A courageous, independent warrior from the Fremen, who inhabit Arrakis. "
"Raised in the age-old traditions of her people, she is unconditionally "
"devoted to her fellow Fremen and defending her home planet, Dune. She is at "
"home in the harsh conditions of the desert planet and is prepared to give "
"everything for the freedom and prosperity of her people."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_2"
msgstr ""
"This young scout's deceptive appearance has proven fatal for many. She is a "
"natural at collecting data on the enemy. Her specialty is radar "
"reconnaissance, where she employs a systematic approach and analytical "
"thinking to the maximum for decision-making. She is capable of taking risks "
"to save her comrades."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_3"
msgstr ""
"This American's formidable appearance hides a sharp mind and a subtle sense "
"of humor. He is not afraid of anything and anybody, or at least so he "
"thinks. For a long time, he fought under the command of McReed, with whom he"
" initially struggled to find common ground due to his own sharp wit. "
"Throughout his career, he successfully completed dozens of combat missions "
"and developed a sense of discipline before becoming a competent commander. "
"That said, he has not stopped making jokes, whether they land well or not."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_4"
msgstr ""
"A leading researcher at the Research Institute (crossed out). Supervisor of "
"the first and subsequent groups sent to Mirny-13. She approaches her work "
"very meticulously, sometimes even obsessively. She does not accept "
"compromises. If she sets a goal, she will stop at nothing to achieve it."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_5"
msgstr ""
"A courageous, independent warrior from the Fremen, who inhabit Arrakis. "
"Raised in the age-old traditions of her people, she is unconditionally "
"devoted to her fellow Fremen and defending her home planet, Dune. She is at "
"home in the harsh conditions of the desert planet and is prepared to give "
"everything for the freedom and prosperity of her people."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_6"
msgstr ""
"A fearless warrior and wise bard whose songs inspire courage in those around"
" him. Having survived the onslaughts of the Harkonnens and Sardaukar "
"warriors, his loyalty to House Atreides is as unwavering as his "
"determination to exact revenge on his mortal enemies. He is adept at finding"
" ways out of seemingly hopeless situations and was able to find common "
"ground with the inhabitants of Arrakis, so armored warfare should not pose "
"him too many problems."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_7"
msgstr ""
"The tyrannical Harkonnen governor of Arrakis is the epitome of power and "
"ruthlessness. He is a fierce warrior and an authoritative commander for whom"
" the end always justifies the means. He demands supreme military discipline "
"from his subordinates and will crush anyone who dares stand in his way."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_8"
msgstr ""
"A Harkonnen soldier known for his cruelty and lack of tolerance for dissent."
" Boasting a keen intellect and razor-sharp military cunning, he has mastered"
" the art of close combat."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp12_9"
msgstr ""
"A skillful and incredibly resilient Imperial Army soldier. He recognizes no "
"authority but that of the Emperor, whose will he executes without "
"hesitation. Years of intense military training have led him to see himself "
"as superior to others. He demonstrates his tactical genius and composure in "
"battle by always choosing the right moment to strike."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_1"
msgstr ""
"A fearless warrior who always stands for what's right, Leonardo is the "
"natural leader of the Turtle gang. When his brothers look to him for "
"inspiration and guidance, Leo is always there for them—whether they "
"appreciate it or not. Armed with an unwavering sense of justice and the "
"courage to act upon it, Leo and his katana are always ready to fight to the "
"very end, because, as he says, \"We Turtles don't know the meaning of the "
"word 'defeat!'\""

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_2"
msgstr ""
"With a brilliant mind and boundless scientific curiosity, Donatello is the "
"brains of the Turtle gang—and he's one Turtle you want by your side when you"
" need a way out of a sticky situation. A true tech wiz, some of his ideas "
"might be a little too zany—and he has a habit of speaking in "
"technobabble—but his quick thinking and innovative inventions have saved the"
" Turtles' shells on more than one occasion."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_3"
msgstr ""
"Cool but rude? Yeah, that's right, and what's it to you? Strong, short-"
"tempered, and with a tongue as sharp as the sai he wields, Raphael is not a "
"Turtle you want to upset. He might come across as a world-weary "
"cynic...okay, he IS a world-weary cynic, but that's only because he cares so"
" deeply about protecting his brothers. Just don't get on his nerves—the only"
" thing that hurts more than Raphael's sai attacks are his sarcastic put-"
"downs."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_4"
msgstr ""
"Fighting crime and standing against evil? Eh. Video games, skateboarding, "
"and a big slice of a pepperoni pizza? Now we're talking! Sure, Mikey's "
"priorities might be a little...different, but he's no slouch. Powered by "
"pizza and with a smile on his face, Mikey is a party dude who lifts his "
"brothers' spirits at the toughest of times—and he's always ready to dish out"
" some serious nunchuck justice. Cowabunga!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_5"
msgstr ""
"Formerly a ninjutsu student named Oroku Saki, the Shredder assumed his new "
"identity after a bitter feud with a fellow student—one Hamato Yoshi. Now "
"leader of the Foot Clan, the Shredder is consumed by an obsessive desire for"
" vengeance against his old rival—now known as Master Splinter—and his Turtle"
" sons. Clad in razor-sharp armor and with loyal enforcers ready to do his "
"evil bidding, he will stop at nothing until he gets his wish: to dine on "
"turtle soup!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_6"
msgstr ""
"Krang may not have a body, but he does have an ambition: to take over the "
"world! Banished to Earth from his home of Dimension X in mysterious "
"circumstances, Krang is hell-bent on world domination, and has joined forces"
" with the evil Shredder to achieve his goal. With some seriously impressive "
"technology at his disposal—including a powerful android body and a mobile "
"battle fortress, the Technodrome—he's not going to let a few measly Turtles "
"stand in his way!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_7"
msgstr ""
"Whaddya mean Bebop ain't the sharpest tool in the shed? The only sharp tools"
" he needs are ones for taking apart Toitles! What he may lack in self-"
"awareness, he makes up for in strength, and Bebop is a real tough guy who's "
"great at following orders. That means he's ready to do whatever the Shredder"
" and his partner-in-crime Rocksteady tell him to—and if that involves "
"teaching some puny little Toitles a lesson, even better!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_8"
msgstr ""
"Hey, Rocksteady's the brains of the operation here! Never seen without his "
"loyal accomplice Bebop, Rocksteady is one mean rhinoceros ready to go to any"
" lengths to do the Shredder's dirty work and teach them Turtles a lesson. "
"Sure, his \"genius\" plans might not always work out, but he's a hard-headed"
" hoodlum who won't stop until they do. When Rocksteady's around, no Turtles "
"are safe from being splatterized!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp13_9"
msgstr ""
"Live for Channel 6 News, New York City's most determined reporter has a "
"knack for being where the action is. With a big heart and an even bigger "
"dedication to getting the greatest scoops, April is a true professional and "
"an invaluable ally to her newfound friends. She's not quite sure how she "
"ended up patrolling the city sewers with a team of crime-fighting Turtles, "
"but one thing is certain—it's going to be the story of the year!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp14_1"
msgstr ""
"A Manchester lad who was raised to value duty, honor, and discipline above "
"all else, Arthur always seemed destined to lead. Now that he serves King and"
" country, his secret weapons are a healthy dose of northern grit to help him"
" through adversity and an English wit dry enough to defuse even the tensest "
"of situations. A natural diplomat and diligent strategist, Arthur is the "
"glue that holds his crew together, maintaining a steely resolve and "
"unwavering focus on the task at hand even when emotions run high."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp14_2"
msgstr ""
"Much to the exasperation of his superiors, Jack hates playing by the rules, "
"preferring to trust his gut and do what feels right instead. Thankfully for "
"all concerned, he's blessed with remarkable intuition and an uncanny ability"
" to improvise his way out of danger. Competitive, courageous, and competent "
"beyond his years, Jack is the all-American ace in his crew's pack, with an "
"unpredictable streak that keeps enemies guessing and an unshakeable "
"confidence that he'll always come up trumps."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp14_3"
msgstr ""
"Passionate, patriotic, and dedicated to his Patrie, Louis' love for his "
"country compelled him to join France's Resistance immediately after the "
"occupation began. But while he always stands for what's right, Louis is not "
"just a hot-headed idealist: as rugged as the cliffs of his native Normandy, "
"he's also a fearless fighter and shrewd tactician with a knack for always "
"seeing the bigger picture. Tireless in his determination, he will stop at "
"nothing until his beloved France knows freedom once more."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp14_4"
msgstr ""
"As devastation began to ravage Poland, Roman knew the time had come to "
"follow in the footsteps of those who had fought through the centuries for "
"his country's freedom. A logical thinker with a plan for all eventualities, "
"he demonstrates exceptional composure even under intense enemy fire. With a "
"kind heart and a classic sense of Polish hospitality, Roman lifts his "
"crewmates' spirits when times are hard—but it's the thought of returning to "
"his homeland once the war finally ends that keeps him going."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp14_5"
msgstr ""
"Drawn by the allure of the black beret, Richard served in the Royal Tank "
"Regiment for nearly 30 years. Having started as a Chieftain driver—where he "
"did more repairing than driving—his journey through the ranks saw him master"
" diverse roles and command various vehicles, including the Challenger 1 and "
"2 and the Scorpion. On top of stints as a Gunnery Instructor and teaching "
"Armored Tactics, Richard also worked with various countries' armed forces "
"during deployments across the globe."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp14_6"
msgstr ""
"David Baggley, aka “eekeeboo”, aka “eek”, is infamous for his quirky tactics"
" and talent for flipping tanks. He occasionally serenades allies with "
"lullabies, boosting his team's morale and leaving enemies fuming. His "
"trademark phrase, \"Boop of nope\", is rumored to be the last thing foes "
"hear before their destruction."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_1"
msgstr ""
"When he was young, Tommy would always be tinkering with something, taking "
"apart family radios and other gadgets just to see what was inside—often to "
"the dismay of his parents. His penchant for experimentation proved more than"
" just child's play, eventually attracting the attention of the Alliance, who"
" tasked him with developing advanced tank shield systems. There, Tommy's "
"scientific flair, combined with his meticulous planning and surgical "
"precision, won him the respect of a certain colleague by the name of Max von"
" Krieger."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_2"
msgstr ""
"Marion was raised with the firm belief that the collective is more important"
" than the individual—and she always wanted to be part of something with "
"truly global significance. When the Alliance came calling and she "
"encountered the boundless ambition of Max von Krieger, she knew she was in "
"the right place. While extremely methodical and rational in her work on EMP "
"technology—which she understands could have far-reaching, even devastating "
"consequences—Marion is always willing to put aside personal concerns to "
"serve the greater good."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_3"
msgstr ""
"Andrey is a man of few words and advocate of decisive action over idle chit-"
"chat. If he has received an order from above, he won't rest until it's "
"carried out—and to the very highest standard at that. His relentless focus "
"on the task at hand can be jarring to those who don't know him, but Andrey "
"isn't interested in proving anything to anyone. He's a model professional "
"whose unparalleled railgun expertise has proven invaluable to the Alliance."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_4"
msgstr ""
"If there's one thing Xing believes in, it's the power of science to change "
"the world for the better. Guided by a strong sense of discipline and a "
"resolute belief that what she is doing is right, she is an energy systems "
"expert of the highest order, always seeking ways to harness the technology "
"she believes can be a force for good. Having left her home to contribute to "
"the mission of the Alliance, her diligent approach and innovative thinking "
"have greatly advanced the organisation's research capabilities."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_5"
msgstr ""
"The legendary Viking king Ragnar Lothbrok is a man of many dreams and many "
"failings. Curious and intelligent yet extremely dangerous, he is driven by "
"an insatiable thirst for conquest and glory. Ragnar has led many daring "
"raids on England and Francia, but not simply for plunder—he seeks to carve "
"his name into legend. And, if the gods will it, he will succeed."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_6"
msgstr ""
"The gods deprived this man of the ability to walk, giving his enemies at "
"least a small chance against him. But Ivar the Boneless, son of Ragnar and "
"Aslaug, is violent and ruthless even by Viking standards. In a world where "
"strength defines men, being crippled is no easy burden, yet Ivar managed to "
"become a ferocious warrior and a master tactician. Although Ragnar "
"recognizes Ivar's unyielding anger as a gift, at times it may cloud his "
"judgment."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_7"
msgstr ""
"Ragnar's oldest son, Bjorn has rarely shown any true interest in being a "
"ruler. Rather, he is an adventurer, just like his father. It is Ragnar's "
"qualities, such as vision and wanderlust, that incite Bjorn to forge his own"
" way in the world. He always strives to do what’s best for his people and, "
"though not always successful, he is a great leader treated with respect. And"
" a great warrior, too—after all, they call him Ironside for a reason."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_8"
msgstr ""
"Lagertha is a proud and earnest shield-maiden who became the first wife of "
"Ragnar Lothbrok—not that she let him dictate her fate, of course. In a time "
"when strength is the key to survival, Lagertha is ready to do whatever it "
"takes to protect her loved ones. With a good number of battles to her name, "
"she can easily discern who is a skilled fighter and who is not. And most "
"men...a single glance is enough for Lagertha to know they are no match for "
"her."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp15_9"
msgstr ""
"An odd hermit, a dangerous trickster, a genius craftsman with a talent for "
"building ships and towers—Floki is too complex a person to be captured in a "
"single phrase. Just like his closest friend Ragnar, he is always searching "
"and exploring the world around him and, true to the Viking ways, he lives to"
" please the gods and help his fellow men. With his infectious giggle, Floki "
"may look innocuous to a stranger, but that nonchalant facade hides a "
"ferocious killer."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_1"
msgstr ""
"A seasoned commander who never leaves a job half-done, Tomasz has two "
"passions: armored vehicles, and, paradoxical though it may seem, the natural"
" world. When not busy motivating his crew to outshine the competition, he "
"can be found with a notebook in hand, documenting the rare flora and fauna "
"of his surroundings. Good-natured, confident, and endlessly inquisitive, "
"Tomasz's boundless curiosity led him to seize the opportunity to take his "
"tanking expertise to the jungles of central Africa, where he balances his "
"love for machinery and nature to impressive effect."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_2"
msgstr ""
"With his air of quiet confidence and iron discipline, Wataru doesn't give "
"the impression of a man who likes to create chaos just for fun. Yet, as a "
"keen motorcycle racer in his youth, he developed a deep love for machines "
"and a mean competitive streak—as well as a defiant disregard for rules and "
"regulations. Though his wild days racing through the neon-lit streets of "
"Tokyo are behind him, his passion for high-octane competition endures—but "
"what drives Wataru most of all is the pursuit of becoming better than the "
"man he once was."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_3"
msgstr ""
"Hailing from a secluded village in the lush mountain forests of southwest "
"Germany, Konrad dreamed of writing a great novel about his native "
"land—because surely there couldn't be anywhere more perfect than his beloved"
" Schwarzwald? Fate, however, had other plans; a rugged, and resourceful "
"military man, he was selected for a key role in groundbreaking tank trials "
"halfway across the world. While he misses the crisp mountain air of his "
"home, the demands of his new surroundings have awakened fresh stories within"
" him—and inspired him to write even more."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_4"
msgstr ""
"A gifted linguist, polyglot, and expert negotiator, Angélique always lands "
"on her feet—no matter the mission or the company she keeps. Armed with the "
"ability to effortlessly adapt to new teams, environments, and challenges, "
"she is a resourceful problem-solver who thrives under pressure. While rumors"
" of her past involvement in covert espionage operations only add to her "
"mystique, Angélique neither confirms nor denies such claims, deflecting "
"awkward questions with her charm, intellect, and relentless focus on the "
"task at hand."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_5"
msgstr ""
"Founding partner of Shelby Company Limited, patriarch of the Shelby family, "
"and mastermind behind the Peaky Blinders' criminal empire, Thomas Michael "
"Shelby is, in his own words, an extreme example of what a working man can "
"achieve. Scarred by his experiences in the trenches of northern France, "
"Tommy can sometimes seem detached and desensitized to violence—but he's "
"determined to secure his family's future. Calculating, ambitious, and "
"utterly ruthless when necessary, he's a master strategist who's always one "
"step ahead of those who seek to challenge him—from Small Heath to London and"
" beyond."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_6"
msgstr ""
"A tortured soul with good in his heart but hands that belong to the devil, "
"Arthur is the man who carries out the Peaky Blinders' dirty work—but he's "
"more than just a brutal enforcer. The eldest of the Shelby brothers, Arthur "
"is driven by an unshakable loyalty to his family and a fierce desire to "
"protect his siblings—yet, after the horrors of the Great War, he finds "
"himself battling inner demons as well as the pressures of gang life. "
"Volatile but vulnerable, Arthur seeks solace, understanding, and, "
"ultimately, redemption."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_7"
msgstr ""
"Like his older brothers, John bears the scars of being sent to fight in "
"foreign lands as a young man—and shares the other Shelbys' sense of loyalty,"
" bravery, and honor. Forced to grow up quicker than the rest, his past "
"weighs heavily on him—especially as he has a family of his own to provide "
"for. While he can be quick to act on impulse, John's heart is in the right "
"place—and his determination to protect those he loves means he's never one "
"to shy away from a fight."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_8"
msgstr ""
"The only sister among the Shelby siblings, Ada initially seeks a life of "
"glitz and glamour far removed from the gritty realities of Small Heath and "
"the Peaky Blinders—but her deep affinity for her family soon sees her drawn "
"into Shelby business. Fearless and uncompromising as she navigates a male-"
"dominated world, Ada has little patience for masculine aggression or her "
"unpredictable brothers' bickering. Armed with a sharp intellect and a biting"
" wit, she is a force to be reckoned with both inside and outside the family."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp16_9"
msgstr ""
"A Shelby in all but name, Michael always harbored ambitions far bigger than "
"the sleepy village he grew up in. Diligent and thoughtful, he is fascinated "
"by the Peaky Blinders and the intrigues of Birmingham's criminal "
"underworld—and eager to play his part in his cousins' ever-growing "
"enterprise. After the dull monotony of life in the country, Michael knows he"
" belongs in the city, even if it means getting his hands dirty. But how far "
"is he willing to go for his family?"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_1"
msgstr ""
"A military man from a military family, Matthew Kennedy doesn’t play "
"games—not in the line of duty, at least. Assertive and ultra-competitive, "
"he's a demanding commander who expects nothing less than excellence from "
"himself and his crew—and if something's off, you’ll hear about it. Yet while"
" he's relentless on the battlefield, off it he's surprisingly charismatic. A"
" Boston boy who takes pride in his Irish roots, he forged an especially "
"strong bond with Angus over their Celtic connection, but Matthew commands "
"the respect—and fear—of all who serve with him."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_10"
msgstr ""
"A brilliant anthropologist and one of Lara's few intellectual equals, Amanda"
" Evert was one of her closest friends during their university days—until a "
"mysterious, tragic event in Peru changed everything. Now, shaped by "
"resentment and a lingering sense of betrayal, Amanda has become both a rival"
" and an uneasy counterpart to Lara. Her fascination with the mystical, the "
"unexplained, and ancient secrets has grown into an obsession—one that often "
"puts her at odds with Lara. Though their paths frequently clash, they remain"
" bonded by their shared past—and their relentless search for truth."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_11"
msgstr ""
"Seven years chopping wood non-stop would have broken most men. But Harry "
"Bunyan was not most men. He liked the routine, and the solitude, and the "
"smell of the pines—and, rain or shine, he could always be found in the quiet"
" corner of the forest clearing he'd made his own. Setting his next target in"
" place and dusting off his hands, he would grip the worn handle of his ax "
"and, with an almighty thwack, split the timber clean in two. All day, every "
"day, for seven years. Where all the logs went, not even Harry knew—there was"
" no way the camp needed that much firewood—but he didn't mind. He just kept "
"chopping."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_12"
msgstr ""
"A field kitchen is no place for a chef, they said. Especially not for a "
"proud Parisian, trained in the haute cuisine traditions of the French "
"capital. But that mattered little to Joël—in fact, it only fueled his "
"appetite for adventure. Stubborn, resourceful, and endlessly inventive, he "
"approached the challenge of working with what little he had to hand with "
"relish and customary verve. Sitting by the fire, he would admire his "
"signature pot-au-feu as it bubbled to a boil, infused with the fresh air of "
"the forest glade—and just the faintest hint of steel."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_13"
msgstr ""
"To call Edmund Hart a stickler for the details would have been like calling "
"water wet, or the Maus heavy. He seemed to always be hunched over a table, "
"poring over maps and blueprints, and telling anyone who'd listen about "
"pincer movements and choke points. His obsession with precision wasn't just "
"limited to sketches and schemes, though: he was also a no-nonsense commander"
" who made damn sure the plan was followed to the letter on the battlefield. "
"And if Plan A failed, you could bet your last bonds he had a Plan B, C, and "
"D up his sleeve."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_14"
msgstr ""
"While Oskar's primary task as camp photographer was strictly "
"technical—document operations and equipment, and try not to get in anyone's "
"way—he saw it as much more. For him, it was about capturing the small "
"details, memories, and moments that would otherwise be forgotten. Unseen by "
"his campmates, he would rise before dawn to be in place for the \"Goldene "
"Stunde\"—the golden hour, when the morning sun would bathe the forest "
"clearing in gentle amber light. To some, it would have been mundane: the "
"same old trees, the same old routines. But Oskar always managed to find the "
"beauty in the everyday."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_15"
msgstr ""
"Busted track? Optics on the blink? Turret not turning? Give Tokarev ten "
"minutes and his battered old toolbox, and it'd be good as new. No job was "
"too small for him, and he had no problem getting his hands dirty—come to "
"think of it, nobody ever saw them clean. Sergei had seen it all and fixed it"
" twice, and built up an encyclopedic knowledge of military hardware in the "
"process. No matter what had broken down, blown up, or fallen off, one thing "
"was always for sure—Sergei would get it moving again."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_2"
msgstr ""
"Angus William Buchanan—better known as \"Cannon\" for short—may just be "
"Scotland’s finest marksman. No surprise there; years of hunting across the "
"wild moors of the Scottish Highlands where he grew up would sharpen anyone’s"
" eye. Such is his shooting prowess that he occasionally toys with leaving "
"tanking behind to apply for the Special Air Service—but, for now, he's quite"
" happy commanding the twin-barrel beast assigned to him. While his hair may "
"be a fiery red, his temperament is anything but. Cool-headed and precise, "
"Angus never rushes a shot—and rarely misses the mark."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_3"
msgstr ""
"Impossible? Not for Wei Jian. Having endured rigorous training, pushed "
"through grueling challenges, and seen off fierce competition to become one "
"of China's foremost tank engineers, he's not afraid of anything. Where most "
"would see obstacles, Wei Jian sees opportunity—and will happily spend hours "
"poring over blueprints and fine-tuning the smallest of components in search "
"of innovation and maximum performance. His expertise isn’t limited to the "
"drawing board, though; on the battlefield, as in the design bureau, his eye "
"for detail and drive for perfection remain uncompromising."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_4"
msgstr ""
"Becoming a tanker never seemed an obvious path for Alessia. It wasn't that "
"she intentionally defied authority—just, as something of a free spirit, she "
"never really recognized it in the first place. But she craved adventure, and"
" the military certainly offered that. A masterful communicator, she believes"
" in the power of negotiation to resolve any dispute. She knows she can win "
"over anyone if she puts her mind to it—but, if her opponents decline her "
"polite offers of dialogue, then she's happy to let her gun do the talking."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_5"
msgstr ""
"Now you see him, now you're dead. Duke is here, and damn, is he looking "
"good! He needs no introduction, but just in case you’ve been living under a "
"rock—meet the world’s greatest action hero, live and uncensored. He’s faced "
"the meanest foes, conquered the deadliest threats, and always emerged "
"victorious. Now he’s back—to kick ass, dominate the battlefield, and save "
"Earth once again. When Duke's around, a few things are guaranteed: big guns,"
" bigger explosions, and all-out destruction. Hail to the king, baby!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_6"
msgstr ""
"An evil cyborg with an army of loyal Techbots to do his bidding, Dr. Proton "
"is Duke's arch-nemesis—and mankind's greatest threat. Once a brilliant "
"robotics researcher, excessive radiation exposure shattered his mind and "
"twisted his genius into madness. Now, consumed by a thirst for total "
"domination, the Dr. is hell-bent on reshaping the world in his image. Deep "
"in his underground lair, he plots his ultimate victory—and only Duke stands "
"between him and the annihilation of humanity."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_7"
msgstr ""
"Duke may go where he pleases—and please where he goes—but if there's one "
"person he knows he can count on when things get hot, it's General Graves. A "
"seasoned professional with a hardened, no-nonsense demeanor, the General has"
" a plan for every alien invasion. With years of fighting existential threats"
" in the Earth Defense Force under his belt, he's armed with unmatched "
"tactical acumen—and the intel Duke needs to get the job done. Together, they"
" make sure the bad guys never stand a chance."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_8"
msgstr ""
"Tomb Raider, relic hunter, and adventure icon, Lara Croft is an intrepid "
"explorer who believes that the extraordinary lies in what we do, not who we "
"are. Heiress to the Croft legacy, she found herself drawn to the allure of "
"the unknown, opting for a life of adventure far beyond the confines of her "
"high-society upbringing. While Lara carries herself with grace and poise, "
"mistake her good manners and charisma for weakness at your peril. Fearless "
"and tenacious, she's no stranger to a hard-fought battle—and can disarm foes"
" just as easily with her razor-sharp wit as with her combat skills."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp17_9"
msgstr ""
"A sailor and cook with a big appetite and an even bigger heart, Jonah Maiava"
" is Lara's closest friend and most trusted confidant. His thoughtful, "
"introspective nature helps keep Lara grounded when her drive pushes her to "
"the edge—while his protection instincts and calm demeanor make him a "
"steadfast companion on even the most perilous expeditions. A true gentle "
"giant with a kind soul, Jonah knows Lara better than anyone else and remains"
" utterly dedicated to his best friend—no matter what the stakes."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_1"
msgstr ""
"Few know where Anton Mekhanin was born—he probably crawled out of a steel "
"hatch wearing a welding mask. A tireless perfectionist, he's turned the art "
"of tank testing into a personal crusade. Known for pushing vehicles to the "
"limit (and beyond), it'll take more than an explosion to make him sweat. "
"Rumor has it that he once rebuilt a busted T-34 using just scrap metal and "
"an Allen wrench. His obsession borders on the unhinged, but no one can argue"
" with his results. Besides, with a name like Mekhanin, how could he have "
"turned out any other way?"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_10"
msgstr ""
"Once a small-town sheriff's deputy, Rick Grimes woke from a coma to find the"
" world overrun by the dead—and the living soon proved no less dangerous. "
"Despite the ruthlessness of this new reality, Rick holds on to his "
"principles as best he can. Guided by a deep sense of duty to protect those "
"he loves, he has evolved from lawman to hardened survivor. A natural leader,"
" he's earned the trust of those who follow him. Morality weighs heavily on "
"him, yet Rick never hesitates to do what's necessary."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_11"
msgstr ""
"Negan is a former high school gym teacher. As brutal as he is charismatic, "
"he's a tyrant to his enemies and a savior to his people. Don't let Negan’s "
"bravado fool you, though—this is a man shaped by loss. His weapon of choice,"
" a baseball bat wrapped in barbed wire, is named Lucille in honor of his "
"late wife. Negan built his following on fear and control, but whether he can"
" rebuild himself into a better human being is another matter entirely."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_12"
msgstr ""
"Rugged survivalist Daryl Dixon grew up on the edges of society, learning "
"early in life what it takes to thrive in harsh circumstances. Lethal with a "
"crossbow and possessing a keen instinct for tracking, his expertise makes "
"him a valuable asset to his group. Though a man of few words, Daryl's "
"loyalty runs deep once you've earned his respect. This is a man who will go "
"to any lengths to protect his newfound family."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_13"
msgstr ""
"Before society fell apart, Michonne was a lawyer. In this lawless new world,"
" her keen situational awareness and pragmatism have proved indispensable to "
"her survival. Michonne once kept two walker pets on leashes to move "
"unnoticed among the hordes of dead—a grim but effective form of camouflage. "
"Always wielding her signature katana, this hardened warrior refuses to let "
"the brutality of the apocalypse cloud her judgment. In her own words: "
"\"Anger makes you stupid. Stupid gets you killed.\""

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_14"
msgstr ""
"Philip Blake, more commonly known as The Governor, maintains strict control "
"over the fortified town of Woodbury. He positions himself as a beacon of "
"safety, promising to shield his community from the chaos beyond the gates. "
"Yet he operates through authoritarian means, his sociopathic tendencies and "
"capacity for violence masked by his outward charm—making him all the more "
"dangerous."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_2"
msgstr ""
"Hugo \"Axle\" Kern is a seasoned tank tester, his iron resolve tempered in "
"the fire of countless trials. His battered wrench never leaves his side—not "
"just for repairs, but to feel the pulse of a machine. He taps the hull, "
"listening intently for the subtle hum that says \"go.\" Any tank that "
"doesn't pass his test is torn apart and rebuilt, no exceptions. With decades"
" of experience and nerves of carbon steel, Hugo forces the future of tank "
"design with each test. Under Kern's stern command, only the strongest, "
"fastest, and most deadly tanks survive."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_3"
msgstr ""
"Lucien Acier is a battlefield tinkerer with a brilliant mind and zero chill."
" Armed with his trusty wrench and a metric ton of wild ideas, he's all about"
" reworking existing vehicles into logic-defying, mind-bending monsters. "
"Engines run hotter, turrets spin faster, and enemy tanks burn brighter—even "
"if nobody's quite sure how (not even Lucien himself). After all, this mad "
"scientist isn't here to follow blueprints. He's here to break the rules and "
"build something revolutionary. If it smokes, sparks, or shakes the ground, "
"odds are Lucien had something to do with it."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_4"
msgstr ""
"Cassie Riggs grew up turning rust buckets into hot rods on her dad's "
"junkyard, and now she does the exact same thing with tanks. Breezing through"
" upgrade sessions and field tests with a signature smirk on her face, Cassie"
" remolds machines like she's daring them to keep up. Crank up the power "
"here, reroute some wiring there—BOOM, you've got a fire-breathing behemoth "
"that's \"technically within regulations.\" She's used to being the only "
"woman on the test field, but that's never fazed her. Cassie knows she's the "
"one they'll call when their arsenal needs to stop surviving and start "
"dominating."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_5"
msgstr ""
"I've been shot and scarred more times than I care to count. They've thrown "
"war machines, genetically-engineered freaks... heck, even entire battalions "
"at me. The USA surrendered, and I kept on fightin’ anyhow. I've seen the "
"world burn and come crawlin' outta the fire. Yeah, I've seen the worst those"
" monsters have to offer—and I've sent it all straight to hell. It ain't that"
" hard: inhale, count to four—exhale, count to four, and I get the job done. "
"So, you with me? 'Cause if we stop, they win. And I don't plan on giving "
"them that satisfaction, not today."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_6"
msgstr ""
"Ah... look at you. So serious, so scared. Delicious.\n"
"\n"
"Weakness is a disease, and I am its cure. I have seen what the world becomes without order: filth, noise, chaos... resistance. But I corrected that. Pain is my instrument, and oh... how beautifully I play. Each scream, a note in my divine symphony. When they beg? When they break? Ach, how it moves me. I demand perfection... and I punish everything else. Do not question me. Do not fail me. Or I will compose your screams into my next masterpiece.\n"
"\n"
"So, mein Schatz, serve with grace... or decorate the floor."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_7"
msgstr ""
"They call me a monster. A madman. I call myself an engineer of human limitations.\n"
"\n"
"I do not waste time on sentiment—I eliminate variables. While the masses cling to their obsolete ethics, I operate beyond the constraints of feeble morality. The human body, in its current state, is a crude, inefficient vessel that cripples our true potential. My work corrects that. I pursue total anatomical supremacy. Lesser minds do not comprehend my methods, but all shall witness the results.\n"
"\n"
"Now, unless your presence contributes to measurable outcomes, begone. Efficiency is everything."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_8"
msgstr ""
"They keep finding people to fight. And we keep fighting. There was a time I "
"thought words alone could change the world—books, ideas, truth. I was a "
"student, once. A dreamer. I thought knowledge would be enough, and then I "
"watched as they burned my home in the name of their twisted vision. I do not"
" dream anymore. Now, I work—with words, with weapons, with whatever I must. "
"I've broadcast from deep underground while bombs fell overhead. I've carried"
" messages, weapons, and fallen allies through smoke-choked tunnels. I've "
"learned to shoot, to lead, to bleed if I must—but always, always to resist."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp18_9"
msgstr ""
"They broke my body in Deathshead's compound—thought that would stop me. "
"It'll take more than that to keep me down. I've led charges from the "
"shadows, dismantled their machines, and kept the Resistance burning long "
"after the world gave up. Da'at Yichud suit or not, I stand. Rebels, "
"radicals, traitors... Let them call us whatever they want, but we're on the "
"right side of history. So if you're here to whine, leave. If you're here to "
"fight, get moving. Targets are marked, tracks are hot. Gear up, soldier, and"
" let's get to work."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_1"
msgstr ""
"When Daniel Zima—a watchmaker by trade—unexpectedly inherited his uncle's "
"radio workshop, he thought the constant hum of tools and crackle of "
"transmissions would drive him mad. But before long, he became captivated by "
"the invisible world of radio waves, spending hours tuning in to signals from"
" far-off places and imagining the lives behind them, worlds far removed from"
" his sleepy Moravian town. Now, in the frozen north, Daniel uses his "
"affinity for mechanisms of all kinds to decode the unseen threads of the "
"wider world, tracking transmissions few others will ever hear."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_2"
msgstr ""
"The daily rigors and shortages of his early life taught Otto Faber that "
"order is the antidote to chaos. He soon found his calling as a "
"reconnaissance specialist, honing an uncanny ability to track signals and "
"decode transmissions with a relentless exactitude that would put even the "
"most meticulous professor to shame. Under Faber's exacting eye, every "
"reading was perfectly precise, every signal catalogued without fail. Yet, "
"despite all his training, the frozen north threw anomalies that confounded "
"even Otto's methodical mind."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_3"
msgstr ""
"Jack Hawke was the son of a coal miner, raised in the shadow of the "
"Appalachians. Gifted with a knack for understanding how things ticked, he "
"enlisted in the Army to make sure he didn't end up working underground. He "
"started in the motor pool and worked his way into the armored corps, earning"
" his stripes on the Alaskan frontier before heading across the Atlantic. "
"Ironically, the boy who had enlisted to avoid life underground now found "
"himself navigating a different kind of hidden world, mapping the frozen "
"expanse on a covert scouting mission."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_4"
msgstr ""
"Elin Bergfalk grew up immersed in amateur radio, spending long winters "
"chasing faint signals across Europe and decoding messages. Her affinity for "
"the invisible currents of the air soon caught the attention of a classified "
"electronic warfare program. There, she quickly earned a reputation for "
"detecting anomalies and interference patterns that baffled even senior "
"officers. Now a seasoned systems engineer and signals intelligence "
"specialist, she has been called back to the frozen landscapes of her "
"youth—this time operating from the camouflaged confines of a tank."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_5"
msgstr ""
"Don't get it mixed up: Paulie Lombardo might enjoy cracking wise every now "
"and then, but he's no stranger to cracking a few heads when the job demands "
"it either. A seasoned mobster with a positive attitude who takes an "
"immediate liking to Tommy, Paulie tries to keep the mood light, even when "
"the situation is anything but. Life in the family, though, weighs him down "
"more than he'd like to admit. Normally amiable and easygoing, he grapples "
"with a deep-rooted malaise and bouts of explosive anger that can have "
"devastating consequences."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_6"
msgstr ""
"Everything Tommy Angelo's ever done, both good and bad, he's done for his "
"family. But he never thought he'd have to do things like this. He was just "
"trying to get by, making ends meet as a cabbie on the streets of Lost "
"Heaven, until a chance encounter—and quick getaway—with Don Salieri's boys "
"turned his life upside down. Now, entangled deeper in a life of crime and "
"racketeering than he could ever have expected, Tommy is a made man who's "
"earned the respect of those around him the hard way. But, whatever happens, "
"family still comes first. Always."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_7"
msgstr ""
"Salieri's best friend since their childhood in Sicily, Frank Colletti is the"
" faithful consigliere who knows the Don better than anyone. An experienced "
"mediator and prudent advisor, he acts as the respectable face of the "
"family's often less-than-respectable enterprises. He knows bloodshed is bad "
"for business, so warns against it where possible: partly to preserve "
"clients' trust, but also because he genuinely cares about Tommy, Paulie, and"
" Sam. His intimate knowledge of the family's inner workings, however, means "
"he's a prime target for those with a score to settle with the Don."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_8"
msgstr ""
"Sam Trapani is the type of enforcer any Don would kill for: street-smart, "
"disciplined, and fiercely loyal to the family code of honor. Having carried "
"out Salieri's orders throughout Little Italy and beyond, he's learned to "
"shoot first and think...actually, he's learned it's best not to think at "
"all. More taciturn and to-the-point than his loudmouth accomplice Paulie, "
"Sam prefers to get things done with maximum efficiency and minimal talk. "
"He's also guided by a strong sense of justice—and won't hesitate in turning "
"the gun on anyone he deems to have wronged him."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp19_9"
msgstr ""
"There are two things Don Ennio Salieri can't stand: foul language and rats. "
"The charismatic head of one of the two families vying for control over Lost "
"Heaven's rackets, Salieri has built up a reputation as a respectable father "
"figure among the people of Little Italy his boys protect. But while he may "
"well care about those under his watch, he cares more about his business—and,"
" when push comes to shove, that pillar of the community facade gives way to "
"the ruthless mob boss beneath. So if Don Salieri makes you an offer, you "
"best damn well think twice before you refuse it."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_1"
msgstr ""
"A veteran of Polish units in North Africa, Eryk Wojciechowski is no stranger"
" to the dunes. Even when visibility vanishes in a cloud of sand or hostile "
"units swarm the convoy like locusts, he remains unnervingly calm. As "
"unflappable as he is mysterious, he is never seen without his damaged "
"wristwatch, its hands stuck in place. Eryk has yet to explain why he refuses"
" to repair it, though he can pinpoint the time of day to the minute with a "
"mere glance across the dunes. He once called Krakow home, but it seems the "
"desert has claimed him since."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_2"
msgstr ""
"Years in Algerian reconnaissance taught Lieutenant Pierre Leclerc to read "
"the land as if it were one of the treasured volumes in his personal library."
" A natural raconteur, he entertains the crew with colorful anecdotes, often "
"lacing his speech with words borrowed from French, Arabic, and local "
"dialects—even in the heat of action. Cunning and observant, he prides "
"himself on noticing what others overlook, stroking his thick beard before "
"delivering a detailed report of events yet to unfold. The desert is friend "
"to no man, but Leclerc comes closer than most."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_3"
msgstr ""
"Captain Li Wei Zhang built his career in remote desert regions where the "
"heat could cripple both engines and men. Enduring such conditions taught him"
" to rely on discipline and preparation above all else. His words are few and"
" direct, but not without warmth—unless he is made to repeat himself or finds"
" a hatch left unsealed against the elements. Zhang expects total competence "
"in every task, but each sunset, regardless of the day's trials, he brews tea"
" in his trusty flask and shares it with his crew. Among the shifting sands, "
"this ritual is a welcome constant."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_4"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Elizabeth Harrington grew up hearing tales of Egyptian expeditions from "
"her officer father, but she laid her own path from the fog and drizzle of "
"London to the deserts and dust of North Africa. An expert geologist and "
"master analyst, she can predict sandstorms hours in advance and maintain her"
" polished poise even in the harshest of conditions. Treating the desert as a"
" matter of diplomacy, she is a firm believer that meticulous notes, careful "
"observation, and respect for the environment will yield the best outcome for"
" all."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_5"
msgstr ""
"Once a respected geneticist, Doctor George Wilhelm Krieger built his career "
"on enhancing soldiers' combat performance. His reputation, however, "
"collapsed when his unsanctioned testing on humans came to light. Forced into"
" exile from the scientific community, he resumed his dealings from the "
"shadows, using his ill-gotten gains to establish a covert research facility "
"on a remote archipelago, guarded by his own private army of mercenaries. "
"There, he seeks to reactivate primal abilities long lost to human "
"evolution—a volatile power that, once unleashed, may be impossible to "
"contain."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_6"
msgstr ""
"Ex-Navy officer Jack Carver puts his lethal set of skills to use as a "
"private boat charter in the South Pacific. When he's hired to take a "
"reporter to a remote island, things quickly get out of hand—his boat is "
"destroyed by a missile fired by mercenaries moments after arrival. Stranded "
"ashore, Jack is contacted by a mysterious insider who reveals the island's "
"disturbing secrets. He soon uncovers a horrific experiment led by the "
"disgraced scientist Dr. Krieger, who plans to replace humanity with "
"engineered super-beings. Now, Jack must stop the operation and find a way "
"back to civilization."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_7"
msgstr ""
"\"You are fearless. You will defeat anyone who stands in your way.\"\n"
"Citra Talugmai is the enigmatic leader of the Rakyat tribe, revered as a living goddess. A warrior of striking beauty, her magnetic presence is matched only by her devotion to her beliefs and her relentless ambition to restore her people to greatness. Through a hypnotic blend of allure and manipulation, she ensnares the outsider Jason Brody, drawing him into her sway and stoking the darkness within him to nurture his descent into madness in service of her own twisted vision."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_8"
msgstr ""
"Talented and intelligent but lacking direction, Jason Brody drifts through "
"life, focusing on partying, extreme sports, and his girlfriend, Liza—despite"
" their clashes over his refusal to buckle down. Now stranded on a hostile "
"island, he is finally forced to concentrate on one goal: rescuing his "
"friends. In the process, he uncovers within himself a frightening capacity "
"for violence, a natural instinct for survival, and a growing thirst for "
"vengeance... along with a place where he might truly belong. But everything "
"comes at a cost, and whether he's willing to pay it remains to be "
"determined."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp20_9"
msgstr ""
"\"Our great and glorious leader who has risked his life and limb to bring Kyrat out of the past. He sacrifices everything for his adopted homeland and loves its people like his own children. May Pagan's light shine upon you all.\"\n"
"Self-styled King of Kyrat, Pagan Min rules the tumultuous and remote nation through a brutal dictatorship enforced by his private army. Flamboyant, sadistic, and brazenly narcissistic, he pivots from playful banter to nauseating brutality in an instant—savoring each with the same refined relish as his impeccably plated meals."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp2_1"
msgstr ""
"People are always asking if I know Jack Reed. Before I answer, I usually "
"take a deep breath and close my eyes for a moment. Being his commander is "
"not a bed of roses. Reed is a rebel who somehow manages to follow orders and"
" stay within the rules imposed by the military. Right now, he's trapped in a"
" hot&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;as&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;hell tank. But deep inside, he's "
"hitting the road so that he can ride his bike down Route 66 and feel the "
"wind in his hair."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp2_2"
msgstr ""
"An experienced, smart, and sensible combat officer who prefers taking the "
"logical option over the emotional one. He easily adapts to any situation and"
" he always follows his orders wherever they may lead him, whether it is to a"
" garrison in the Arctic Circle or a military base in the sands of North "
"Africa. He enjoys hockey and spearfishing, although it is getting harder "
"and harder to find the time for it."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp3_1"
msgstr ""
"Badaev's comrades sometimes think that he doesn't have any sense of "
"self&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;preservation. He recklessly volunteers to participate "
"in any undertaking thrown at him. He says that life without adventure is "
"unimaginably boring, and you've got to have some stories to tell your "
"grandchildren someday."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp3_2"
msgstr ""
"The commander of an expedition to Antarctica, this disciplined and well-"
"trained soldier's only priority is to successfully complete the mission. "
"However, under the guise of a hard-boiled military man, there is a kind-"
"hearted person who takes care of his people."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp3_3"
msgstr ""
"Impeccable training and a good upbringing always help Barton keep his cool, "
"even when his \"&zwnbsp;primary irritant,&zwnbsp;\" Badaev, is somewhere "
"close by. However, these two commanders have become good friends and "
"colleagues. You won't make it long during wartime without acting as a team."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp5_1"
msgstr ""
"A French mechanic who worked in a car repair shop in Dijon before the war. A"
" member of the Resistance responsible for resupplying and maintaining "
"hardware, such as armaments and even captured German tanks. Always glad to "
"participate in any crazy undertaking if there is a chance to improve his "
"knowledge of vehicles."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp5_2"
msgstr ""
"An impulsive and active woman who demonstrated outstanding performance in "
"battle training. Considers herself a descendant of the noble Chodkiewicz "
"family, so she spends a lot of time studying history, especially everything "
"related to the Polish army of the 16th and 17th centuries. She is sure that "
"it is impossible to build modern strategies without taking the lessons of "
"the past into account (even when considering new developments)."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp5_3"
msgstr ""
"An American tanker who fought on the Western Front and took part in the "
"liberation of Paris. Since late 1944, he has worked as an agent, completing "
"missions for American intelligence in Argentina where he searches for signs "
"of German presence. He speaks Spanish and easily adapts to changing "
"environments. He dreams of \"&zwnbsp;finishing here as soon as "
"possible&zwnbsp;\" and returning to his son Jack whom he has never really "
"met because of the war."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp6_1"
msgstr ""
"With his brother Jean-Marc, he started his tour of duty in the Resistance. "
"He was seriously injured and lucky to be alive, but he never lost his "
"phenomenal combat skills, even after a long recovery period. He was glad to "
"get back on track and throw himself into another dangerous adventure. The "
"one thing he regretted was that he and his brother were assigned to "
"different detachments."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp6_2"
msgstr ""
"An MI6 staff officer. She was constantly getting into discussions with her "
"superiors, trying to prove that wars could not be won in dusty offices. As a"
" result, she was assigned to an Antarctic expedition with the most severe of"
" field conditions. And that was all she needed: There's no better way to "
"sort out and solve a problem than to face it."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp6_3"
msgstr ""
"A tank officer and battalion commander. He had excellent combat skills and "
"an intuition that always helped him get out of seemingly hopeless "
"situations. He tried to learn enemy methods and habits to hit them in their "
"weak spots. His military cunning and prudence helped him lead his soldiers "
"to victory, even when outnumbered."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp7_1"
msgstr ""
"Calm, cool, and carefree—this is how you might feel when talking to this "
"laidback (and mildly conceited albeit undoubtedly talented) serviceman. "
"Irony and sarcasm are his main companions, and everybody in his unit at this"
" point knows that he is only in the army because he lost a bet to his "
"friends back home. However, he always sees boundaries that should not be "
"crossed, and he always acts composed and professional when needed."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp7_2"
msgstr ""
"Thanks to a rich library in her parents' home, one can say that, since early"
" childhood, she traveled to all sorts of worlds created by literary "
"classics&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;from Homer to Robert Howard. In the evenings, if "
"there is an opportunity, she likes to go over the events of the day in her "
"head, trying to construct elegant, eloquent sentences. She believes it helps"
" keep the mind sharp during service."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp7_3"
msgstr ""
"An experienced serviceman and former cavalry. A true professional you can "
"set your watch by—German punctuality and discipline can be seen in his every"
" action. He knows his strengths well, does not look for trouble or take "
"risks, and protests any deviation from the plan. Well educated, he can hold "
"his own in almost any conversation. Afraid of spiders."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp7_4"
msgstr ""
"Graduate of the Military Armored Forces Academy who unexpectedly discovered "
"in himself an artistic talent that he is successfully developing in rare "
"moments of respite from the service. In his satchel is a whole bunch of "
"pencils, friendly caricatures of his comrades, landscapes, and still moments"
" of frontline life."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_1"
msgstr ""
"A competent, reliable, and level-headed officer, Lieutenant Thassius now "
"serves in the Ultramarines 2nd Company. He has directed Impulsor units in "
"the field for decades, putting into practice the teachings of the "
"Codex&nbsp;Astartes. These years have honed his tactical skills and he is "
"adept at breaking through enemy defenses with extreme efficiency."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_2"
msgstr ""
"A Champion in one of the Death&nbsp;Guard's elite units known as the "
"Poxmongers. He is an implacable warrior and, when Nurgle allows it, he "
"wallows slothfully in the blessings of his&nbsp;Grandfather’s gifts. He "
"always rises to the occasion when he is presented with the opportunity to "
"frustrate the efforts of his loyalist enemies. He is driven by pure spite "
"and can be counted on to accomplish his mission against the Ultramarines. In"
" the pursuit of victory, he has been known to use the most…unimaginable "
"methods."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_3"
msgstr ""
"A reckless Mekboy who is always in pursuit of two things: more speed and "
"more dakka. Anything that does not contribute to those two commodities he "
"tends to ignore. He knows enemy vehicles very well, considering them not as "
"threats but rather as objects of possible looting to get more speed and more"
" dakka!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_4"
msgstr ""
"He views himself as one of Nurgle's favorites, but arguably rates himself "
"too highly. He will use any means, including blunt force, in an effort to "
"prove his loyalty to&nbsp;Grandfather if he thinks the methods will further "
"his pursuit of favor. His ambition and fanatical desire to gain approval "
"could be considered negative qualities, but they have been paying off so "
"far."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_5"
msgstr ""
"A Battle Sister of significant prowess. She fervently dedicated herself to "
"her pious duties from an early age and felt her calling to fight in the "
"Emperor's name while still a student at her Schola&nbsp;Progenium. More "
"recently, a localized Warp storm has delayed her arrival at the latest field"
" of battle, leaving her frustrated at being unable to do the Emperor's will."
" She considers it a mark of eternal shame. A fervent zealot, she seeks "
"redemption in any battle her Order&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;and her bolter and war "
"machine&zwnbsp;—&zwnbsp;sees fit to attend."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_6"
msgstr ""
"By a happy coincidence of circumstances, she took command of a tank, which "
"was built with money raised on a collective farm where her father is the "
"chairman. She now considers it a matter of honor to fully master this "
"vehicle and unleash its potential so that the work of hundreds of people is "
"not wasted."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_7"
msgstr ""
"Known as Mademoiselle Ice, she is cold-blooded, prudent, almost emotionless."
" She never makes decisions in a hurry and always works out all the possible "
"outcomes and consequences with mathematical precision. She could be an "
"excellent staff officer but believes that you cannot see the whole picture "
"of a battle from the rear."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp8_8"
msgstr ""
"A journalist for a London-based periodical who needs to be personally "
"present, at the center of events, experiencing everything that is going on "
"for better quality and more objective material. By some miracle, she forged "
"her way and became a tank commander, now writing about her emotions and "
"first&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;hand experiences. Many years later, this approach "
"would be called \"&zwnbsp;gonzo journalism.&zwnbsp;\""

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp9_1"
msgstr ""
"This real-life combat officer has suffered countless battle wounds "
"throughout his years of service. How he's remained unbroken and battle ready"
" after all this time remains a mystery. Even in official documents, he "
"refuses to use his real name, Mancini. Instead, he prefers to go by an alias"
" he chose himself to reflect his incredible luck."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp9_2"
msgstr ""
"A uniquely contradictory officer. On the one hand, he's a real master of his"
" trade and boasts excellent training. However, on the other, he "
"wholeheartedly despises anything and everything related to war and military "
"service. This likely has something to do with his family history, but he "
"doesn't talk about it much. And everyone knows better than to ask him about "
"it."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bp9_3"
msgstr ""
"This former actress once played a tank commander in a "
"mid&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;budget film. However, her dedication to the role "
"inspired her to undergo such intensive military training that she was later "
"able to abandon her unstable acting career and enter military service. The "
"work was more fulfilling and it brought great pride to her father, who "
"served&nbsp;in&nbsp;the Normandie&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;Niemen Fighter Regiment."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bph_1"
msgstr ""
"One of the autonomous anthropomorphous endoskeleton mechanism models created"
" by Cyberdyne&nbsp;Systems (designation: CSM&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;101) to perform"
" combat missions. The machine's processor, which works in expanded mode, is "
"able to learn, providing a considerable advantage in case mission parameters"
" change. The T&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;800 is considered the most effective (and "
"most iconic) specimen out of the entire range of terminators."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bph_2"
msgstr ""
"A 10&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;year&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;old boy and the future leader of a"
" global resistance movement in the war between machines and humans. The main"
" enemy of Skynet. To eliminate him, the network sent its most advanced "
"creation: the T&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;1000. However, knowing Skynet's plans, the "
"future John Connor decided to protect himself by sending a reprogrammed "
"T&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;800 machine to the past, which completed the mission and "
"eliminated the threat to the (then non&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;existent, but still "
"very important) future resistance."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bph_3"
msgstr ""
"John Connor's mother. She knows about his destiny and prepares him for his "
"role as the future resistance leader. Her attempts to tell the world about "
"the future forced her into isolation, which put the whole of humanity under "
"immense threat. However, even in captivity, she remained strong in spirit. "
"After being reunited with her son and his unlikely protector, she continued "
"the battle against Skynet. One of the most memorable female characters in "
"cinema."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_bph_4"
msgstr ""
"The newest and most advanced (at the time) terminator model, which was "
"created by Skynet to eliminate John Connor. Unlike older endoskeletons, it "
"consists of liquid metal alloy that is capable of shape shifting and mimicry"
" to blend in with its environment. It is not susceptible to mechanical "
"destruction, and basically invulnerable to firearms. Despite being mass-"
"produced in the future, it was used very rarely. In fact, Skynet considered "
"the cutting-edge self-learning chip a potential threat to the network."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb1_1"
msgstr ""
"The leader of Shu Han's Five Tiger Generals. A red-faced warrior with a "
"dignified air who stands at a height of nine chi, Guan Yu was widely known "
"for his loyalty, righteousness, benevolence, and bravery. Having sworn to "
"face all hardship with his sworn brothers, he valued his lord over any fame "
"or wealth. Both a brave fighter and a cultured scholar, he would be hailed "
"by later generations for his many virtues."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb1_2"
msgstr ""
"Guan Yu's eldest son. Brave and strong since childhood, he inherited his "
"father's qualities of loyalty and righteousness, becoming a patriot who "
"would risk his life to defend his state. Following his father into battle, "
"he performed numerous heroic deeds and intimidated enemies with his valor. "
"Later generations respectfully call him \"Lord Guan's Son\" and worship both"
" him and his father, passing down their legends."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb1_3"
msgstr ""
"Guan Yu's second son. Discovered at the age of 20 by the Prime Minister, he "
"held the high-ranking positions of Palace Attendant and Middle Military "
"Inspector. Just like his father, he was brave and skillrful in wars, and "
"became one of the leading generals in late Shu Han. He made significant "
"contributions to various northward expeditions and, though his life was cut "
"short at a young age, his reputation as a loyal and brave warrior has "
"endured through the ages."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb1_4"
msgstr ""
"Legend says he was a son of Guan Yu. Stationed in Yunnan, Guan So became "
"widely known for his heroism."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb1_5"
msgstr ""
"With his remarkable strength and giant build, Zhou Cang was first a "
"subordinate of the Yellow Turban rebel leader Zhang Bao before he became "
"Guan Yu's bodyguard. When Guan Yu attended a meeting armed with only a "
"blade, Zhou Cang accompanied him and carried his blade. Brave and strong, he"
" caught Pang De in the water. Forever loyal to Guan Yu, he took his own life"
" after learning his lord was no more. He would later be honored as General "
"Weining and the Marquis of Wulie, and worshipped alongside Guan Yu."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb1_6"
msgstr ""
"Guan Yu's daughter. Born in an era of great unrest, Guan YinPing learned the"
" essence of martial arts from her father at a young age, and by 18 was a "
"superb fighter. When Jingzhou fell, she returned to Chengdu and joined Liu "
"Bei's forces before accompanying the Prime Minister on his southward "
"expedition. She married Li Wei, the son of Shu general Li Hui, and settled "
"in Yuyuan, bringing prosperity to the area. Though her life story was mostly"
" passed down through folklore, Guan YinPing's image as a woman of valor "
"means she has been revered throughout the centuries."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb4_1"
msgstr ""
"The leader of the Six Sages and Erlang Shen's top general. Born with divine "
"strength, he wields a crescent-moon spade. He is a calm, resolute strategist"
" who commands the army. As Erlang Shen's most trusted confidant, he is "
"consulted on all major decisions. He assisted in subduing the Min River and "
"splitting Peach Mountain. During the Siege of Mount Huaguo, he blocked the "
"escape routes and helped capture the Great Sage."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb4_2"
msgstr ""
"The second sage, known as Commander Zhang. He wields a brilliant silver "
"spear with dragon-like speed. Possessing a deep hatred for evil, he is "
"always the first to lead the charge. He suppressed the demons of the "
"Seventy-Two Caves and slew a thousand-year-old flood dragon in the Min "
"River. During the Investiture of the Gods and the campaign against the "
"Monkey King, his bravery in battle earned him a fearsome reputation across "
"the realm."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb4_3"
msgstr ""
"The third sage, Commander Li. A man of immense physical stature and infinite"
" strength, he favors the spiked mace. Known for his steady composure, he "
"never wavers in the heat of battle. He assisted Erlang Shen to clear paths "
"and was the first to break through the gates of the Water Curtain Cave at "
"Mount Huaguo."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb4_4"
msgstr ""
"The fourth sage, Commander Yao. He wields dual hooks with lightning speed "
"and unpredictable technique. Fierce yet sharp-witted, he often serves among "
"the vanguard. Having followed Erlang Shen on numerous campaigns, his valor "
"during the Investiture of the Gods and the siege of the Monkey King was so "
"great that demons fled at the sight of him."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb4_5"
msgstr ""
"The fifth sage, General Guo. He is exceptionally agile, wielding his staff "
"so quickly that it becomes a blur. His movements are like lightning, and his"
" strikes carry the force of a thunderclap. As a man of integrity who honors "
"his word, he excels at scouting and ambushing, often venturing deep into "
"demon dens to gather intelligence for Erlang Shen."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_mtlb4_6"
msgstr ""
"The sixth sage, General Zhi, serves as Erlang Shen's personal bodyguard. His"
" prowess in archery is superb, drawing his bow like a full moon and firing "
"arrows like falling stars. No less brave than his brothers, he is "
"straightforward, charismatic, and fiercely loyal. During the battle at Mount"
" Huaguo, he fought side-by-side with Erlang Shen and personally captured "
"several monkey generals."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_pm3_1"
msgstr ""
"The daughter of anti-fascist scientists from Dresden, Leni was left alone "
"when her parents were arrested and disappeared in concentration camps during"
" the war. Finding refuge in the underground resistance, she underwent combat"
" training and quickly became a highly skilled sniper and spy. As hostilities"
" raged, Leni orchestrated sabotage operations, eliminated high-ranking "
"officers, and gathered intelligence for the Allies. Even when the war ended,"
" she continued her pursuit of justice, hunting former Nazis with special "
"units—and attracting the interest of Sector 3, who brought her into their "
"ranks."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_pm3_2"
msgstr ""
"Growing up in a blacksmith's family in a small Czech town, Miroslav was no "
"stranger to physical labor from a young age—and learned early on that "
"strength wasn't just about hard work, but about responsibility, too. When "
"Czechoslovakia fell under occupation, he put his skills to use in the "
"resistance movement, using his strength and engineering expertise to "
"organize sabotage plots. After the war, he played a key role in rebuilding "
"Czechoslovakia's tank industry—before finding a new outlet for his talents "
"in Sector 3."

msgid "tankman/lore/tankmen_pm3_3"
msgstr ""
"Born into a military family in Virginia, Corvin was raised in an environment"
" of discipline and exacting standards. His outstanding analytical mind led "
"him first to West Point, where he graduated magna cum laude, then across the"
" Atlantic to the North African and European theaters of World War II. "
"Throughout the war, his unconventional strategic thinking and composure "
"under pressure set him apart, whether as an intelligence officer or unit "
"commander. After the war, he continued to serve in the U.S. Army's analytics"
" department, where his remarkable track record caught the attention of "
"Sector 3."

msgid "tankman/lore/tc2023_commander_1"
msgstr ""
"TalkToMeGoose, an illustrious commander with a passion for tanks, is now "
"your wingman in World of Tanks! Known for his dedication, friendliness, and "
"enthusiasm, TalkToMeGoose is a World of Tanks veteran ready to lead your "
"crew to a phenomenal victory!"

msgid "tankman/lore/tc2023_commander_2"
msgstr ""
"Skieeeel AKA Skill4ltu, the baboon king, the legend, the master of bananas, "
"and a masterful World of Tanks commander, steps onto the battlefield to "
"stand by your side. With a rich history in the game, the king baboon himself"
" is ready to lead your crew to triumph."

msgid "tankman/lore/theboys_commander"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. He keeps"
" the entire crew in line, whether they like it or not, like a true leader "
"should."

msgid "tankman/lore/theboys_driver"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. He is a "
"\"&zwnbsp;jack of all trades&zwnbsp;\" and knows everything there is to know"
" about guns."

msgid "tankman/lore/theboys_gunner"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. He is "
"desperate for revenge, but keeps a cool head in any situation. A "
"\"&zwnbsp;demolition expert&zwnbsp;\"."

msgid "tankman/lore/theboys_loader"
msgstr ""
"One of the main characters in the&nbsp;Amazon series The&nbsp;Boys. He "
"demonstrates great self&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;control and makes sure that the crew"
" is always on track."

msgid "tankman/lore/tigersMidfielder"
msgstr ""
"Whisper the name Roberto Montagna in the ear of any footballer and watch their eyes widen in terror. A stalwart of the Tigers' midfield for the past decade, his passion and never-say-die attitude have won him the adoration of fans and the dread of opponents, who'll do anything it takes to avoid his bone-crunching tackles.\n"
"It's not just the opposition he has fearing for their legs, though. If you're on Montagna's team and having a bad match, or you’re a referee whose decisions he deems \"questionable\", well...you either up your game fast or prepare for the dressing-room dressing-down of your life."

msgid "tankman/lore/tigersWinger"
msgstr ""
"In Billy Trotter's day, football wasn't for the faint-hearted. The ball was heavier, the tackles were harder, and the pitches were more battlefields than sporting venues. But Billy had served his country with valor in the war, and none of that was going to faze him. The trickiest winger of the time, he would dance past defenders in a blaze of black and orange, leaving them seeing double before firing a rocket of a shot into the top corner.\n"
"Precious little footage remains of Billy plying his trade for the Tigers. But his name still echoes around the terraces at every home game."

msgid "tankman/lore/twitch_commander_germany"
msgstr ""
"A commander of the people, \"Ferdi\" knows how to drive panzers in World of "
"Tanks."

msgid "tankman/lore/twitch_commander_uk"
msgstr ""
"He might be missing an eye, but \"Nelson\" is more than equipped for battle "
"thanks to his perks."

msgid "tankman/lore/twitch_commander_usa"
msgstr ""
"A former military engineer who participated in the testing of his own "
"vehicles. He quickly became obsessed, so much so that he decided to retrain "
"as a tank commander, and later as an instructor."

msgid "tankman/lore/twitch_girl_commander"
msgstr ""
"Measure twice, cut once. That's what this instructor always says during "
"training. Plan and prepare thoroughly before taking action, as you might not"
" get a second chance."

msgid "tankman/lore/twitch_guy_commander"
msgstr ""
"A true mercenary, Alex \"&zwnbsp;The&nbsp;Hunter&zwnbsp;\" Duke is just in "
"it for the thrill of the fight."

msgid "tankman/lore/women_Beijing_Opera"
msgstr ""
"A crew member dressed like a Beijing&nbsp;opera actor. This is one of the "
"most famous forms of Chinese traditional opera both in China and around the "
"world."

msgid "tankman/lore/women_Edelweiss"
msgstr ""
"A crew member of the Edelweiss tank, a combat vehicle from the Japanese "
"video game, manga, and anime Valkyria&nbsp;Chronicles."

msgid "tankman/lore/women_Nameless"
msgstr ""
"A crew member of the Nameless tank, a combat vehicle from the Japanese video"
" game, manga, and anime Valkyria&nbsp;Chronicles."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt22_boss_commander"
msgstr ""
"Max von Krieger's daughter. This talented robotics engineer was among the "
"first to successfully integrate artificial intelligence into the controls "
"system of a heavy vehicle. She does everything in her power to keep her "
"father's secrets and breakthrough inventions out of the Alliance's hands."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt22_hunter_commander"
msgstr ""
"The commander of the Alliance's battle wing, and an old personal "
"acquaintance of von&nbsp;Krieger. Although she does not consider her old "
"Steel&nbsp;Hunter partner an enemy of humanity (like some of the "
"higher&zwnbsp;-&zwnbsp;ups in the Alliance do), she's determined to put an "
"end to his family's dangerous games before&nbsp;their electric experiments "
"spin out of control."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2023_driver"
msgstr ""
"Fresh from the academy, this commander is eager to prove her skill in "
"battle. She trained in cavalry-style battlefield maneuvers and is used to "
"surveying the battlefield carefully to use it to her advantage. Although "
"lacking experience, she is a master of several new technologies and battle "
"techniques and might just teach the old dogs some new tricks."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2023_hannelore"
msgstr ""
"Despite being Ermelinda's sister, Hannelore is her exact opposite. A "
"strategic mastermind, she joined the Harriers to prevent her evil sister "
"from making irreparable mistakes. She still believes that Ermelinda can be "
"saved and will do anything to put her on the right track."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2024_dakillzor"
msgstr ""
"Renowned for his strategic brilliance, Agent Dakillzor leads with "
"unparalleled precision. A master tactician, he navigates the battlefield "
"with exceptional ease, while his combat expertise is a force to be reckoned "
"with. Attend to his broadcasts to be briefed in the art of heavy armored "
"machinery perfected."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2024_ermelinda"
msgstr ""
"So you thought I was defeated last time around? Hah! I'm stronger and faster"
" than ever before, with unbounded technology to ensure truth prevails!"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2024_mouzakrobat"
msgstr ""
"Meet Agent Mouzakrobat, a seasoned veteran whose weathered beard hints at his vast battlefield experience. You might think his reflexes have dulled over years of battle, but he has withstood every trial. Through countless conflicts, he exemplifies bravery and finesse, demonstrating all that's needed to defeat von Krieger's minions.\n"
"Follow his lead to master the art of cunning German tactics."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2024_quickybaby"
msgstr ""
"Agent QuickyBaby, the unyielding vanguard and stalwart defender of all "
"Harriers, stands firm against the tide of Max von Krieger and his forces. "
"Join his drills to learn how to lead your team to victory with unmatched "
"prowess and determination!"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2024_skill4ltu"
msgstr ""
"A beacon of strength and hope, Agent Skill4ltu can single-handedly turn the "
"tide of battle in favor of his team. Lock onto his transmissions to learn "
"the true value of teamwork and collaboration on the battlefield in "
"Waffenträger encounters and beyond!"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_2024_vonkrieger"
msgstr ""
"I have ascended, returning to bring you the forbidden fruit of knowledge. "
"You did well, my daughter. Now, let us save this unguided world!"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_CN2024_bmeng"
msgstr ""
"他是当时寥寥无几的科班出身的装甲兵军官，曾在军事工程学院装甲兵工程系学习以及远赴北国装甲兵学院留学深造。由于其自身卓越的才能，学成归来不久便被委以重任，组织并参与了在核生化条件下的装甲兵突击演习。"
" 迄今为止，他是装甲兵部队中，对于电磁危害以及防护最有经验的指挥官。"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_CN2024_saonian"
msgstr ""
"虽然他身材瘦小，但是他在维修坦克时总有使不完的力气。他对过去的经历守口如瓶，讳莫高深。他不苟言笑，只会在解决了坦克车辆的疑难杂症之后才会露出一丝笑容。\n"
"从语焉不详的档案上得知，他过去曾在某实验基地的坦克部队中服役，曾参加过某次保密级别很高的特别任务。在那次任务中，只有他一人生还。"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_CN2024_yituantuan"
msgstr ""
"是科学院某研究所最年轻的研究员，其学生时代曾随其导师研究过电离层扰动的相关机制，对无线电传导机理有非常丰富的了解。 "
"除了丰富的学识之外，她似乎对坦克使用和作战方面也有着不错的天赋。在教导队中，只用了半年就让其水平与非常资深的坦克兵指挥官相当。真可谓是巾帼不让须眉！"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_CN2024_zhongpengfei"
msgstr ""
"虽然长着一副娃娃脸，但是他的装甲兵经验十分的老道。早在装甲兵建立伊始，他便成为了一名英勇的装甲兵战士。他天生具有猎人般的战场直觉，在他的战争岁月中曾击杀敌方坦克十数辆，而自身毫发无损。相信，他的加盟可以让探险小队的作战实力倍增，让任何敌人在我们面前望而却步。"

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_boss_commander"
msgstr ""
"An outstanding German engineer. Designer of advanced armaments and defense "
"systems based on harvesting electricity and completely controlling it. One "
"of the pioneers of robotics who believes that the main load in modern "
"conflicts must fall onto machines rather than their operators."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_clone_boss"
msgstr ""
"You call this a time loop. How primitive. This is revelation—stripping away "
"illusion, repeating until your minds are finally ready. It tests your will, "
"your reason, your very sense of reality. Each cycle peels away another layer"
" of who you were before. Each return brings you closer to understanding...or"
" madness."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_clone_hunter_1"
msgstr ""
"Igor doesn’t waste time speculating about time. He sees repeating patterns, "
"broken timelines, strange resets—but his focus stays on keeping the machines"
" running and the team alive. Improvisation, trust, and good steel—that’s how"
" you punch through anything, even reality bending in on itself."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_clone_hunter_2"
msgstr ""
"Elisa is back where she belongs—inside the tank, surrounded by systems she "
"understands better than most. As a specialist in recovering and studying "
"advanced tech, she doesn’t take this \"time loop\" at face value. While "
"others fight the same battle again and again, she’s searching for the "
"pattern—and the flaw that will break it."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_clone_hunter_3"
msgstr ""
"No one knows who Armand really is, and he’s in no hurry to explain. Others "
"may worry about the repeating battle, but he sees only opportunities—to "
"strike, to vanish, to stay ahead. Fast, unpredictable, and always in motion,"
" Armand doesn’t follow rules. He outruns them."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_clone_hunter_4"
msgstr ""
"Jana may be one of the younger commanders, but she doesn’t follow anyone’s "
"lead—she reads the battlefield like a map and bends it to her will. "
"Combining modern tech with sharp instincts, she’s ready to prove that even "
"in a world stuck on repeat, there’s always room for bold tactics."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_hunter1"
msgstr ""
"An experienced commander and mechanic who is very familiar with the "
"equipment provided by the Alliance. He is formally considered the leader of "
"the operation but does not single himself out—he believes that success "
"depends on everyone working together, as well as the personal initiative of "
"every person on the team. He is sure that well-executed and well-timed "
"improvisation can salvage any situation, even when something goes completely"
" wrong."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_hunter2"
msgstr ""
"A graduate of the N Cave, which is a special Alliance combat training "
"department responsible for finding and capturing (or recovering) valuable "
"technology for further research under the authority of the organization. She"
" is very respectful of von&nbsp;Krieger's activities but believes that both "
"he and his technology belong within the Alliance's walls."

msgid "tankman/lore/wt_hunter3"
msgstr ""
"Real name and biographical details unknown. Nationality is only assumed, as "
"well. Obviously, the Alliance wouldn't sign up just anybody for such a "
"crucial operation, but the fact that the identity of this tanker is unknown "
"even to their team raises many suspicions and speculations."

msgid "tankman/lore/yandex_1"
msgstr ""
"Yana is a versatile tank combat specialist, who can perform any role in the "
"crew equally well. She is stress-resistant, a quick learner, and a true team"
" player."

msgid "tankman/lore/yha_commander"
msgstr ""
"The captain of this flourishing tank team. Calm, funny, and able to make "
"sound judgments on the battlefield, he's the backbone of the team."

msgid "tankman/lore/yha_driver"
msgstr ""
"The youngest hare in the team. He brings more vitality to the team, but he "
"lacks battlefield experience. There are still many things for him to learn."

msgid "tankman/lore/yha_gunner"
msgstr ""
"A gunner who gets the job done better than most. On the battlefield, she "
"loves nothing more than showing 'em who's boss."

msgid "tankman/lore/yha_loader"
msgstr ""
"He has a simple and honest personality and likes all kinds of food. He can "
"adjust the atmosphere and mood of the team easily."

msgid "tankman/lore/yha_radioman"
msgstr ""
"The oldest hare on the team. Although he has reached middle age, his stamina"
" and energy remain as high as ever."
